    "Live child total; category and cost not available yet": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Aktuell totalsumma för underagenter; kategori och kostnad är ännu inte tillgängliga"}}}},
    "Main agent": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Huvudagent"}}}},
    "Open Session Info": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Öppna sessionsinfo"}}}},
    "Price catalog %@": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Priskatalog %@"}}}},
    "Session usage is being indexed.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Sessionens användning indexeras."}}}},
    "Token breakdown": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Tokenfördelning"}}}},
    "Total": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Totalt"}}}},
    "Transcript index unavailable": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Transkriptindex är inte tillgängligt"}}}},
    "Usage: %@": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Användning: %@"}}}},
    "Keep this Mac awake while agents work": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Håll Mac-datorn vaken medan agenter arbetar"}}}},
    "Power": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ström"}}}},
    "Prevents idle system sleep while an agent turn is active or waiting for your answer. The display may turn off, and closing a MacBook’s lid can still put it to sleep.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Förhindrar automatisk systemvila medan en agenttur är aktiv eller väntar på ditt svar. Skärmen kan släckas, och datorn kan fortfarande försättas i vila om du stänger locket på en MacBook."}}}},
    "%1$@ · %2$@ · by %3$@": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%1$@ · %2$@ · av %3$@"}}}},
    "This switch is the global master. Manager grants stay stored but are inert while it is off. Start a manager from a project's + menu, or make and revoke one from a chat's menu.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Den här brytaren är huvudreglaget. Managerbehörigheter förblir sparade men är inaktiva när det är av. Starta en manager från ett projekts +-meny eller skapa och återkalla en från en chatts meny."}}}},
    "Grants the selected chat authority to coordinate this project.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ger den valda chatten behörighet att samordna det här projektet."}}}},
    "Immediately removes the selected manager's extra authority.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Tar omedelbart bort den valda managerns extra behörighet."}}}},
    "Opens this project's composer with the Manager role selected.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Öppnar projektets komponerare med rollen Manager vald."}}}},
    "Select a project first.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Välj ett projekt först."}}}},
    "The selected chat is already a manager.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Den valda chatten är redan en manager."}}}},
    "The selected chat is not a manager.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Den valda chatten är inte en manager."}}}},
    "%1$@, %2$@, brief: %3$@, last event: %4$@": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%1$@, %2$@, brief: %3$@, senaste händelse: %4$@"}}}},
    "%lld managed chats": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%lld hanterade chattar"}}}},
    "1 managed chat": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "1 hanterad chatt"}}}},
    "Agent Authority": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Agentbehörighet"}}}},
    "Archive chat": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Arkivera chatt"}}}},
    "Assigned": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Tilldelad"}}}},
    "Briefs and events are read from Threading's supervision record, not this manager's transcript.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Briefer och händelser läses från Threadings övervakningspost, inte från managerns transkription."}}}},
    "Chats": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Chattar"}}}},
    "Couldn't undo the account move": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Det gick inte att ångra kontoflytten"}}}},
    "Dormant": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Vilande"}}}},
    "Every manager loses its extra tools immediately, and every supervised chat is released. You can make individual chats managers again later.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Varje manager förlorar omedelbart sina extra verktyg och varje övervakad chatt frisläpps. Du kan göra enskilda chattar till managers igen senare."}}}},
    "Exited": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Avslutad"}}}},
    "Idle": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Inaktiv"}}}},
    "Immediately removes every manager grant and releases all chats they supervise. Regular chat tools are unchanged.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Tar omedelbart bort varje managerbehörighet och frisläpper alla chattar de övervakar. Vanliga chattverktyg ändras inte."}}}},
    "Limit nearing": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Gränsen närmar sig"}}}},
    "Managed chats": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Hanterade chattar"}}}},
    "Manager roles": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Managerroller"}}}},
    "One or more manager roles could not be revoked. Roles already revoked remain revoked.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "En eller flera managerroller kunde inte återkallas. Roller som redan har återkallats förblir återkallade."}}}},
    "Message chat": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Skicka meddelande till chatt"}}}},
    "Moved": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Flyttad"}}}},
    "Moved to %1$@ by %2$@": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Flyttad till %1$@ av %2$@"}}}},
    "No events yet": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Inga händelser ännu"}}}},
    "No managed chats yet. Spawn or adopt a chat to keep its brief and events here.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Inga hanterade chattar ännu. Starta eller adoptera en chatt för att samla dess brief och händelser här."}}}},
