    "Find in diff": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Sök i diffen"}}}},
    "Increase diff text size": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Öka textstorleken i diffen"}}}},
    "Search unavailable": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Sökning är inte tillgänglig"}}}},
    "Checks unavailable": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Kontroller är inte tillgängliga"}}}},
    "Open %@ in Git Review": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Öppna %@ i Git-granskning"}}}},
    "Open attachment": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Öppna bilaga"}}}},
    "Open attachment in Attachments": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Öppna bilagan i Bilagor"}}}},
    "Open in Attachments": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Öppna i Bilagor"}}}},
    "Open change request in Git Review": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Öppna ändringsförfrågan i Git-granskning"}}}},
    "Open checks in Git Review": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Öppna kontroller i Git-granskning"}}}},
    "Open the Attachments pane": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Öppna Bilagor-rutan"}}}},
    "Use Default": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Använd standard"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "View all %lld attachments": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Visa alla %lld bilagor"}}}},
    "View all attachments": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Visa alla bilagor"}}}},
    "Status card checks reach your code host": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Statuskortets kontroller når din kodvärd"}}}},
    "Threading has no usage tracking and no identifier for this install. The network requests its product features make are described below; none of them is analytics.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Threading har ingen användningsspårning och ingen identifierare för den här installationen. Nätverksanrop som produktfunktionerna gör beskrivs nedan; inget av dem är analys."}}}},
    "While the session status card is on, Threading asks GitHub or GitLab for the branch's open change request and checks. GitHub uses your available connection, or anonymous access for a public repository; GitLab uses glab. Turning off the card stops these lookups.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "När konversationens statuskort är på frågar Threading GitHub eller GitLab efter grenens öppna ändringsförfrågan och kontroller. GitHub använder din tillgängliga anslutning eller anonym åtkomst för ett offentligt arkiv; GitLab använder glab. Om du stänger av kortet stoppas dessa uppslagningar."}}}},
    "%@ — the default for new chats in Settings.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%@ — standardvalet för nya chattar i Inställningar."}}}},
    "%@ — this agent's own setting.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%@ — den här agentens egen inställning."}}}},
    "%@ — what this agent last ran in. It decides again each launch.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%@ — det som den här agenten kördes med senast. Den väljer på nytt vid varje start."}}}},
    "A demonstration animation": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "En demonstrationsanimation"}}}},
    "A document that varies over time, drawn by the host. The registry decodes it, the player owns the clock, and the clock stops the moment nothing can see it — another tab, a collapsed pane, an occluded window.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ett dokument som ändras över tid, ritat av värden. Registret avkodar det, spelaren äger klockan, och klockan stannar i samma stund som ingen kan se den — en annan flik, en hopfälld ruta, ett skymt fönster."}}}},
    "A position the user sets. Drag it, or traverse to it and use the arrow keys — Shift for the fine step. The receipt below tells the travel from the commit: a seek happens once, at the end.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "En position som användaren ställer in. Dra den, eller flytta fokus dit och använd piltangenterna — Skift för det fina steget. Kvittot nedan skiljer förflyttningen från bekräftelsen: en sökning sker en gång, i slutet."}}}},
    "Continue at Reset": { "localizations" : { "sv" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Fortsätt vid återställning" } } } },
    "Continues at reset": { "localizations" : { "sv" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Fortsätter vid återställning" } } } },
    "Continuing when the window resets.": { "localizations" : { "sv" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Fortsätter när fönstret återställs." } } } },
    "Copy Frame": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Kopiera bildruta"}}}},
    "Has its own settings": { "localizations" : { "sv" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Har egna inställningar" } } } },
    "MediaDocumentCanvasView": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "MediaDocumentCanvasView"}}}},
    "MediaDocumentPlayerView": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "MediaDocumentPlayerView"}}}},
    "MediaDocumentPlayerView reported “%@”.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "MediaDocumentPlayerView rapporterade ”%@”."}}}},
    "MediaTransportView": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "MediaTransportView"}}}},
    "MediaTransportView asked to pause.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "MediaTransportView bad om paus."}}}},
    "MediaTransportView asked to play.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "MediaTransportView bad om uppspelning."}}}},
    "MediaTransportView sought to %lld%%.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "MediaTransportView sökte till %lld%%."}}}},
    "MediaPlaybackOverlayView": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "MediaPlaybackOverlayView"}}}},
    "MediaPlaybackOverlayView asked to pause.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "MediaPlaybackOverlayView bad om paus."}}}},
    "MediaPlaybackOverlayView asked to play.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "MediaPlaybackOverlayView bad om uppspelning."}}}},
    "No preview extension is available for this file.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Inget tillägg kan förhandsvisa den här filen."}}}},
    "No project with that identifier is open.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Inget projekt med den identifieraren är öppet."}}}},
    "Notifications muted": { "localizations" : { "sv" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Aviseringar tystade" } } } },
    "Notifications on": { "localizations" : { "sv" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Aviseringar på" } } } },
    "Pause": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Pausa"}}}},
    "Play": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Spela upp"}}}},
    "Playback": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Uppspelning"}}}},
    "Playback position": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Uppspelningsposition"}}}},
    "Position": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Position"}}}},
    "Project files are unavailable.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Projektfiler är inte tillgängliga."}}}},
    "Running at last quit": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Kördes vid senaste avslut"}}}},
    "Recently used": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Nyligen använda"}}}},
    "At most %d": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Högst %d"}}}},
    "Bring back at launch": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ta tillbaka vid start"}}}},
    "Counts as recently used": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Räknas som nyligen använd"}}}},
    "How far back to look. Measured from the last time a turn ran in the conversation, not from the last time Threading opened it.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Hur långt tillbaka som räknas. Mäts från senaste turen i konversationen, inte från senaste gången Threading öppnade den."}}}},
    "Inside the restore window, past the limit of %d.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Inom återställningsfönstret, men över gränsen på %d."}}}},
    "It kept running in the background after Threading quit, and has since stopped.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Den fortsatte köra i bakgrunden efter att Threading avslutades, och har sedan stoppats."}}}},
    "It was not running when Threading last quit.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Den kördes inte när Threading avslutades senast."}}}},
    "Last used %@, outside the %@ restore window.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Senast använd %@, utanför återställningsfönstret på %@."}}}},
    "Launch restore is switched off.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Återställning vid start är avstängd."}}}},
    "Most recent first. Each one is a real agent process, so this is the ceiling on what a launch may start.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Senast använda först. Varje session är en riktig agentprocess, så det här är taket för vad en start får starta."}}}},
    "Scheduling…": { "localizations" : { "sv" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Schemalägger…" } } } },
    "Sessions brought back": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Sessioner som tas tillbaka"}}}},
    "Sessions resume in the background, one at a time, and are already running when you open them. Everything else stays dormant and resumes when you open it.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Sessioner återupptas i bakgrunden, en i taget, och körs redan när du öppnar dem. Övriga förblir inaktiva och återupptas när du öppnar dem."}}}},
    "Settings ▸ General decides what comes back at launch.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Inställningar ▸ Allmänt bestämmer vad som kommer tillbaka vid start."}}}},
    "Stop here and continue when the usage window resets": { "localizations" : { "sv" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Stanna här och fortsätt när användningsfönstret återställs" } } } },
    "Stops at its limit": { "localizations" : { "sv" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Stannar vid sin gräns" } } } },
    "That session does not belong to this project.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Den sessionen hör inte till det här projektet."}}}},
    "The animation container could not be read.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Animationsbehållaren kunde inte läsas."}}}},
    "The animation contains no frames.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Animationen innehåller inga bildrutor."}}}},
    "The animation could not be read as an image.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Animationen kunde inte läsas som en bild."}}}},
    "The animation has more than the %lld frames this player accepts.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Animationen har fler än de %lld bildrutor som spelaren accepterar."}}}},
    "The animation has more than the %lld layers this player accepts.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Animationen har fler än de %lld lager som spelaren accepterar."}}}},
    "The animation has no layers this player can draw.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Animationen har inga lager som spelaren kan rita."}}}},
    "The animation has no readable size.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Animationen har ingen läsbar storlek."}}}},
    "The animation is larger than the %lld-pixel limit on either axis.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Animationen är större än gränsen på %lld bildpunkter på någon av axlarna."}}}},
    "The animation is longer than the %lld seconds this player accepts.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Animationen är längre än de %lld sekunder som spelaren accepterar."}}}},
    "The animation is missing its frame rate or layers.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Animationen saknar bildfrekvens eller lager."}}}},
    "The animation is not a readable Lottie document.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Animationen är inte ett läsbart Lottie-dokument."}}}},
    "The animation's out point is not after its in point.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Animationens slutpunkt ligger inte efter dess startpunkt."}}}},
    "The bounded surface a document is drawn on. Its three grounds: the pane’s own surface, the checkerboard that says the document has transparency, and nothing at all.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Den begränsade ytan ett dokument ritas på. Dess tre bakgrunder: rutans egen yta, schackrutmönstret som säger att dokumentet har genomskinlighet, och ingenting alls."}}}},
    "The container expands to more than this player accepts.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Behållaren packas upp till mer än vad spelaren accepterar."}}}},
    "The container holds more than the %lld entries this player accepts.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Behållaren innehåller fler än de %lld poster som spelaren accepterar."}}}},
    "The container holds no animation this player can read.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Behållaren innehåller ingen animation som spelaren kan läsa."}}}},
    "The current frame could not be copied.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Den aktuella bildrutan kunde inte kopieras."}}}},
    "The current frame could not be decoded.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Den aktuella bildrutan kunde inte avkodas."}}}},
    "Mute": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ljud av"}}}},
    "Unmute": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ljud på"}}}},
    "The movie could not be read.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Filmen kunde inte läsas."}}}},
    "The movie has no readable size.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Filmen har ingen läsbar storlek."}}}},
    "The movie is larger than the %lld-pixel limit on either axis.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Filmen är större än gränsen på %lld bildpunkter på någon av axlarna."}}}},
    "This file carries no video to play.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Filen innehåller ingen video att spela upp."}}}},
    "This movie is in a format this Mac cannot play.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Filmen har ett format som den här Macen inte kan spela upp."}}}},
    "The document is larger than the %@ this player accepts.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Dokumentet är större än de %@ som spelaren accepterar."}}}},
    "The last quit left no record of what was running.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Det senaste avslutet lämnade ingen notering om vad som kördes."}}}},
    "Commits in each of the past 12 weeks, oldest to newest: %@": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Incheckningar under var och en av de senaste 12 veckorna, äldst till nyast: %@"}}}},
    "Latest commit %@": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Senaste incheckning %@"}}}},
    "No commits yet": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Inga incheckningar ännu"}}}},
    "Past 12 weeks · %@ commit": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Senaste 12 veckorna · %@ incheckning"}}}},
    "Past 12 weeks · %@ commits": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Senaste 12 veckorna · %@ incheckningar"}}}},
    "Past 12 weeks · %@+ commits": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Senaste 12 veckorna · %@+ incheckningar"}}}},
    "Recent activity": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Senaste aktivitet"}}}},
    "Apple's system-authored sign-in workflow, contained by the design boundary.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Apples systemskapade inloggningsflöde, inneslutet av designsystemets gräns."}}}},
    "HostedServiceSignInButton": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "HostedServiceSignInButton"}}}},
    "Account deletion failed. Try again.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Kontot kunde inte raderas. Försök igen."}}}},
    "Delete Account": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Radera konto"}}}},
    "Delete hosted account?": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Radera värdtjänstkontot?"}}}},
    "The page marker no longer matches this query.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Sidmarkören stämmer inte längre med den här frågan."}}}},
    "The session is not showing the limit prompt.": { "localizations" : { "sv" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Sessionen visar inte gränsdialogen." } } } },
    "The transport a host-owned media player wears: play/pause, the scrubber and a monospaced-digit reading. It owns no clock — it states what it was told and raises what the user did.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Kontrollerna som en värdägd mediaspelare bär: spela/pausa, reglaget och en avläsning med fasta siffror. Den äger ingen klocka — den visar det den fått veta och rapporterar det användaren gjorde."}}}},
    "ThemedScrubber": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ThemedScrubber"}}}},
    "ThemedScrubber committed %lld%%.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ThemedScrubber bekräftade %lld%%."}}}},
    "ThemedScrubber travelled to %lld%%.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ThemedScrubber flyttades till %lld%%."}}}},
    "The movie's centred Play action. Start it and the control clears from the frame; hover the movie to bring Pause back.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Filmens centrerade uppspelningsknapp. Starta filmen så försvinner knappen från bilden; håll pekaren över filmen för att visa Paus igen."}}}},
    "There is no usage reading yet to schedule against.": { "localizations" : { "sv" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Det finns ännu ingen användningsavläsning att schemalägga mot." } } } },
    "This document is no longer available to the extension.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Dokumentet är inte längre tillgängligt för tillägget."}}}},
    "This permanently removes your Threading service account, revokes direct access for every paired iPhone, and signs this Mac out. Local chats and settings stay on this Mac.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Detta tar permanent bort ditt konto hos Threadings tjänst, återkallar direktåtkomst för alla parkopplade iPhone-enheter och loggar ut denna Mac. Lokala chattar och inställningar finns kvar på denna Mac."}}}},
    "Hosted Direct": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Direktanslutning"}}}},
    "Not configured in this build": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Inte konfigurerat i den här versionen"}}}},
    "Not signed in": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Inte inloggad"}}}},
    "Sign Out": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Logga ut"}}}},
    "Sign in failed. Try again.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Inloggningen misslyckades. Försök igen."}}}},
    "Sign in to enable zero-setup access": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Logga in för åtkomst utan konfiguration"}}}},
    "Sign out failed. Try again.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Utloggningen misslyckades. Försök igen."}}}},
    "Signed in": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Inloggad"}}}},
    "Temporarily unavailable": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Tillfälligt otillgänglig"}}}},
    "This surface cannot play media documents.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Den här ytan kan inte spela mediadokument."}}}},
    "Threading carries no player for “%@” documents.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Threading har ingen spelare för ”%@”-dokument."}}}},
    "Its checkout or working directory changed before a terminal could accept the command.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Dess checkout eller arbetskatalog ändrades innan en terminal kunde ta emot kommandot."}}}},
    "Project Scripts": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Projektskript"}}}},
    "Run Command": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Kör kommando"}}}},
    "Run a command available in the current window.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Kör ett kommando som är tillgängligt i det aktuella fönstret."}}}},
    "Run in Terminal": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Kör i terminal"}}}},
    "Run “%@”?": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Köra ”%@”?"}}}},
    "Script: %@": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Skript: %@"}}}},
    "Scripts": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Skript"}}}},
    "Search commands": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Sök kommandon"}}}},
    "Select a project or checkout first.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Välj först ett projekt eller en checkout."}}}},
    "The project script did not start": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Projektskriptet startade inte"}}}},
    "This repository defines the command below. It will run in %@ only after you choose Run.\n\n%@": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Det här kodförrådet definierar kommandot nedan. Det körs i %@ först när du väljer Kör.\n\n%@"}}}},
    "Unavailable in the current context.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Inte tillgängligt i det aktuella sammanhanget."}}}},
    "Unavailable in the current window.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Inte tillgängligt i det aktuella fönstret."}}}},
    "Unavailable while Threading is in recovery mode.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Inte tillgängligt när Threading är i återställningsläge."}}}},
    "The project configuration must be a regular file, not a symbolic link.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Projektkonfigurationen måste vara en vanlig fil, inte en symbolisk länk."}}}},
    "The project configuration exceeds the 128 KiB discovery limit.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Projektkonfigurationen överskrider gränsen på 128 KiB för identifiering."}}}},
    "The project configuration changed while it was read and now exceeds 128 KiB.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Projektkonfigurationen ändrades medan den lästes och överskrider nu 128 KiB."}}}},
    "The project configuration must be a JSON object.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Projektkonfigurationen måste vara ett JSON-objekt."}}}},
    "The $schema field must be a non-empty string of at most 2048 bytes without control characters.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Fältet $schema måste vara en icke-tom sträng på högst 2048 byte utan kontrolltecken."}}}},
    "The scripts field must be an array.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Fältet scripts måste vara en array."}}}},
    "The project configuration could not be read: %@.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Projektkonfigurationen kunde inte läsas: %@."}}}},
    "Wait for Reset": { "localizations" : { "sv" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Vänta på återställning" } } } },
    "Working directory “%@” resolves outside this checkout.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Arbetskatalogen ”%@” leder utanför den här checkouten."}}}},
    "Working directory “%@” does not exist in this checkout.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Arbetskatalogen ”%@” finns inte i den här checkouten."}}}},
    "The project configuration is not valid JSON: %@.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Projektkonfigurationen är inte giltig JSON: %@."}}}},
    "Unknown project configuration field: %@.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Okänt fält i projektkonfigurationen: %@."}}}},
    "Project configuration version must be %lld.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Projektkonfigurationens version måste vara %lld."}}}},
    "The project declares %lld scripts; at most %lld are allowed.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Projektet deklarerar %lld skript; högst %lld är tillåtna."}}}},
    "Script %lld repeats the ID “%@”.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Skript %lld upprepar ID:t ”%@”."}}}},
    "Script %lld must be a JSON object.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Skript %lld måste vara ett JSON-objekt."}}}},
    "Script %lld has an unknown field: %@.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Skript %lld har ett okänt fält: %@."}}}},
    "Script %lld needs a lowercase ID of 1–64 bytes using letters, numbers, dots, underscores, or hyphens.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Skript %lld behöver ett gemener-ID på 1–64 byte med bokstäver, siffror, punkter, understreck eller bindestreck."}}}},
    "Script %lld needs a non-empty display name of at most 96 bytes without control characters.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Skript %lld behöver ett icke-tomt visningsnamn på högst 96 byte utan kontrolltecken."}}}},
    "Script %lld needs a one-line command of at most 4096 bytes without control characters.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Skript %lld behöver ett enradigt kommando på högst 4096 byte utan kontrolltecken."}}}},
    "Script %lld has an invalid SF Symbol name.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Skript %lld har ett ogiltigt SF Symbol-namn."}}}},
    "Script %lld has an invalid workingDirectory; use . or a checkout-relative path without .. components.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Skript %lld har en ogiltig workingDirectory; använd . eller en checkout-relativ sökväg utan ..-komponenter."}}}},
    "Script %lld previewURL must be an absolute http or https URL without credentials.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Skript %lld:s previewURL måste vara en absolut http- eller https-URL utan inloggningsuppgifter."}}}},
    "This script is no longer available in the active checkout.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Skriptet är inte längre tillgängligt i den aktiva checkouten."}}}},
    "A block of authored lines that morphs one line at a time. These are the composer's own two values: a greeting on one line against a manager's brief on three, so the block gains and loses lines as it goes." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ett block med korta rader som morfar en rad i taget. Det är startvyns egna två värden: en hälsning på en rad mot en managers brief på tre, så att blocket både får och tappar rader."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Git Review creates a draft %@ when you press Create." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Git Review skapar ett utkast till %@ när du trycker på Skapa."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Git Review creates a ready %@ when you press Create." : {
