    "GitLab created the merge request, but Threading could not read its response. Discover it before retrying.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "GitLab skapade merge requesten, men Threading kunde inte läsa svaret. Sök efter den innan du försöker igen."}}}},
