    "DiffSkeletonView": { "extractionState": "manual", "localizations": { "sv": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "DiffSkeletonView" } } } },
    "The ghost a review row holds while its diff is deferred. Each file's own added and removed counts split the changed run, so the silhouette never invents a removal the file does not have.": { "extractionState": "manual", "localizations": { "sv": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Skuggan en granskningsrad håller medan dess diff är uppskjuten. Varje fils egna antal tillagda och borttagna rader delar den ändrade sekvensen, så silhuetten hittar aldrig på en borttagning som filen inte har." } } } },
    "ThemedChartPlaceholderView": { "extractionState": "manual", "localizations": { "sv": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "ThemedChartPlaceholderView" } } } },
    "What a chart says with no series: work in flight on the left, a finished empty answer on the right.": { "extractionState": "manual", "localizations": { "sv": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Vad ett diagram säger utan serier: pågående arbete till vänster, ett färdigt tomt svar till höger." } } } },
    "Cost and tokens appear here once an agent session has run.": { "extractionState": "manual", "localizations": { "sv": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Kostnad och tokens visas här när en agentsession har körts." } } } },
    "Looking for local transcripts.": { "extractionState": "manual", "localizations": { "sv": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Letar efter lokala transkript." } } } },
