    "It is removed from Threading. The saved conversation on disk is not deleted, so it could still be imported again later.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Det tas bort från Threading. Den sparade konversationen på disken tas inte bort, så den kan fortfarande importeras igen senare."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its process will stop. The package, settings, key-value data, cache, and provenance move to Threading’s recoverable Removed directory. Keychain secrets remain under the extension identifier for an intentional reinstall; remove them from the extension before uninstalling if they should not be retained.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Processen stoppas. Paket, inställningar, nyckelvärdesdata, cache och ursprungsinformation flyttas till Threadings återställningsbara katalog Removed. Nyckelringshemligheter ligger kvar under tilläggets identifierare för en avsiktlig ominstallation. Ta bort dem från tillägget före avinstallation om de inte ska sparas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its sessions are removed from the sidebar. Saved conversations are not deleted.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
