    "Send to Developer": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Skicka till utvecklaren"}}}},
    "Sends a private report to Threading. Nothing is sent until you press Send.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Skickar en privat rapport till Threading. Inget skickas förrän du trycker på Skicka."}}}},
    "⌘Return sends the report · Return adds a line": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "⌘Retur skickar rapporten · Retur lägger till en rad"}}}},
    "Sending…": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Skickar…"}}}},
    "Sending to Threading’s private inbox…": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Skickar till Threadings privata inkorg…"}}}},
    "Report received. Reference: %@": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Rapporten har tagits emot. Referens: %@"}}}},
    "Report saved securely and queued for retry when Threading is active.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Rapporten har sparats säkert och placeras i kö för nytt försök när Threading är aktivt."}}}},
    "Previous launch ended unexpectedly": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Föregående start avslutades oväntat"}}}},
    "Report received": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Rapporten har tagits emot"}}}},
    "Threading’s developer inbox received the crash summary. Reference: %@": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Threadings utvecklarinkorg tog emot kraschsammanfattningen. Referens: %@"}}}},
    "Report saved": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Rapporten har sparats"}}}},
    "The crash summary is saved securely and will retry when Threading is active.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Kraschsammanfattningen har sparats säkert och försöker igen när Threading är aktivt."}}}},
    "Couldn’t send report": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Kunde inte skicka rapporten"}}}},
    "Threading couldn’t prepare the private report. Nothing was sent.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Threading kunde inte förbereda den privata rapporten. Inget skickades."}}}},
    "The report did not pass Threading’s privacy checks.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Rapporten klarade inte Threadings integritetskontroller."}}}},
    "The private report outbox is full.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Utkorgen för privata rapporter är full."}}}},
    "The screenshot could not be made safe for upload.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Skärmbilden kunde inte göras säker för uppladdning."}}}},
    "The report service returned an unreadable response.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Rapporttjänsten returnerade ett oläsbart svar."}}}},
    "The report service refused the request (%lld).": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Rapporttjänsten avvisade begäran (%lld)."}}}},
    "AnnotatedImageView / ImageAnnotationRailView": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "AnnotatedImageView / ImageAnnotationRailView"}}}},
    "A picture you can point at. Click it anywhere to drop a numbered pin and a field for it appears beside it; click a pin to put the caret in its field, and put the caret in a field to light its pin. The tie runs both ways because the question is always which mark is this one. Space opens the picture full size, where the same marks are editable over the zoomed image. The pin is the browser overlay's pin, deliberately.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "En bild du kan peka p\u00e5. Klicka var som helst f\u00f6r att s\u00e4tta en numrerad n\u00e5l, s\u00e5 dyker ett f\u00e4lt upp bredvid den. Klicka p\u00e5 en n\u00e5l f\u00f6r att s\u00e4tta mark\u00f6ren i dess f\u00e4lt, och s\u00e4tt mark\u00f6ren i ett f\u00e4lt f\u00f6r att t\u00e4nda dess n\u00e5l. Kopplingen g\u00e5r \u00e5t b\u00e5da h\u00e5llen, eftersom fr\u00e5gan alltid \u00e4r vilken markering det h\u00e4r \u00e4r. Mellanslag \u00f6ppnar bilden i full storlek, d\u00e4r samma markeringar g\u00e5r att redigera ovanp\u00e5 den zoomade bilden. N\u00e5len \u00e4r webbl\u00e4sarlagrets n\u00e5l, med flit."}}}},
