            "value": "Arbetskopians sökväg"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "uncommitted changes stay local": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "oincheckade ändringar stannar lokalt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ThemedSecureField": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ThemedSecureField"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Test account password": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lösenord för testkonto"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The same well with AppKit's secure cell inside it, so masking, the pasteboard rules and the input-method log stay where the system puts them. Deliberately no reveal control: a field that can be un-masked puts a password on screen while an agent may be driving the app beside it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Samma brunn med AppKits säkra cell inuti, så att maskering, reglerna för urklipp och loggen för inmatningsmetoder stannar där systemet placerar dem. Medvetet ingen visa-knapp: ett fält som kan avmaskeras lägger ett lösenord på skärmen medan en agent kan styra appen bredvid det."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Could not save the test credential (%lld).": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Det gick inte att spara testinloggningen (%lld)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Could not read the test credential (%lld).": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Det gick inte att läsa testinloggningen (%lld)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Could not delete the test credential (%lld).": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Det gick inte att ta bort testinloggningen (%lld)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The stored test credential could not be read.": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Den sparade testinloggningen kunde inte läsas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sign in with a test credential": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Logga in med en testinloggning"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fill a stored test account for this exact origin. Never returns the value.": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fyll i ett sparat testkonto för exakt detta ursprung. Returnerar aldrig värdet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Browser Sign-In": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Webbinloggning"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sign-in values come from": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Inloggningsuppgifter hämtas från"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS AutoFill and password managers": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS autofyll och lösenordshanterare"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Threading test credentials": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Threadings testinloggningar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1Password (not yet available)": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1Password (inte tillgängligt än)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Threading never sees a password. When an agent reaches a sign-in field the browser is revealed with that field focused, and you complete it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Threading ser aldrig något lösenord. När en agent når ett inloggningsfält visas webbläsaren med fältet fokuserat, och du fyller i det."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agents may fill test accounts you store below, without asking, on the exact origin each is stored for. Deliberately less protected than a password manager: store only throwaway accounts. Everything else still asks.": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agenter får fylla i testkonton du sparar nedan, utan att fråga, på exakt det ursprung vart och ett sparats för. Medvetet sämre skyddat än en lösenordshanterare: spara bara engångskonton. Allt annat frågar fortfarande."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not available in this build. Sign-in falls back to revealing the field for you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Inte tillgängligt i den här versionen. Inloggning återgår till att visa fältet för dig."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No test credentials stored": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Inga testinloggningar sparade"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add a throwaway account and agents can sign in to that exact origin without you typing it. Never store a real account here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lägg till ett engångskonto så kan agenter logga in på exakt det ursprunget utan att du skriver något. Spara aldrig ett riktigt konto här."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add…": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lägg till…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agents may fill this account on this exact origin.": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agenter får fylla i det här kontot på exakt det här ursprunget."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Another test account": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ytterligare ett testkonto"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add a Test Credential": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lägg till en testinloggning"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agents may fill this account, without asking, on this exact origin only. Threading stores it in your Keychain without a Touch ID prompt, which is what makes unattended filling possible — so store only an account you would not mind losing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agenter får fylla i det här kontot, utan att fråga, endast på exakt det här ursprunget. Threading sparar det i din nyckelring utan Touch ID-fråga, vilket är det som gör obevakad ifyllnad möjlig — spara därför bara ett konto du inte skulle sakna."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lägg till"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is a throwaway test account": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Det här är ett engångstestkonto"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "http://localhost:3000": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "http://localhost:3000"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "admin": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "admin"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Username or email (optional)": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Användarnamn eller e-post (valfritt)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The test credential was not added": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Testinloggningen lades inte till"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter the origin as a full URL, for example http://localhost:3000 or https://staging.example.com.": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ange ursprunget som en fullständig URL, till exempel http://localhost:3000 eller https://staging.example.com."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Give the account a name so an agent can ask for it by name.": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ge kontot ett namn så att en agent kan efterfråga det med namn."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A test credential needs a password.": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En testinloggning behöver ett lösenord."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is not on this machine. Tick “This is a throwaway test account” to store a credential for it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ finns inte på den här datorn. Kryssa i ”Det här är ett engångstestkonto” för att spara en inloggning för det."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ looks like a real account provider. Threading's test credentials are stored without a Touch ID prompt so agents can use them unattended, which is not safe for an account you care about.": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ ser ut att vara en riktig kontoleverantör. Threadings testinloggningar sparas utan Touch ID-fråga så att agenter kan använda dem obevakat, vilket inte är säkert för ett konto du bryr dig om."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stored in your login Keychain, and removed by Reset Everything. This build cannot use the protected Keychain, so a command line on this Mac — including an agent's — could add or delete entries here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sparas i din inloggningsnyckelring och tas bort av Återställ allt. Den här versionen kan inte använda den skyddade nyckelringen, så en kommandorad på den här datorn — inklusive en agents — skulle kunna lägga till eller ta bort poster här."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stored in your protected Keychain, out of reach of the command line, and removed by Reset Everything.": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sparas i din skyddade nyckelring, utom räckhåll för kommandoraden, och tas bort av Återställ allt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "no password could be read for that item": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "inget lösenord kunde läsas för den posten"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1Password": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1Password"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1Password could not read the item: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1Password kunde inte läsa objektet: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1Password did not answer in time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1Password svarade inte i tid."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The 1Password command line (op) is not installed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1Passwords kommandorad (op) är inte installerad."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The 1Password item has no password field.": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1Password-objektet har inget lösenordsfält."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agents may fill the 1Password items you point at below, on the exact origin each is stored for. 1Password still authorizes every read, so it may ask you to unlock. Threading stores only the item reference, never the value.": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agenter får fylla i de 1Password-objekt du pekar ut nedan, på exakt det ursprung vart och ett sparats för. 1Password godkänner fortfarande varje läsning och kan be dig låsa upp. Threading sparar bara objektreferensen, aldrig värdet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The 1Password command line (op) is not installed, so sign-in falls back to revealing the field for you. Install it from 1Password's developer settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1Passwords kommandorad (op) är inte installerad, så inloggning återgår till att visa fältet för dig. Installera den från 1Passwords utvecklarinställningar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No 1Password items linked": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Inga 1Password-objekt länkade"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Point an origin at a 1Password item and agents can sign in to it without you typing anything.": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Peka ut ett 1Password-objekt för ett ursprung så kan agenter logga in där utan att du skriver något."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Link…": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Länka…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Link": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Länka"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Another 1Password item": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ytterligare ett 1Password-objekt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Threading stores the reference only. 1Password holds the value.": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Threading sparar bara referensen. 1Password har värdet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Link a 1Password Item": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Länka ett 1Password-objekt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agents may sign in with this item on this exact origin. Threading stores only the reference — 1Password keeps the value and authorizes every read, so it may ask you to unlock.": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agenter får logga in med det här objektet på exakt det här ursprunget. Threading sparar bara referensen — 1Password har värdet och godkänner varje läsning, så det kan be dig låsa upp."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "op://Private/staging-admin": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "op://Private/staging-admin"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The 1Password item was not linked": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1Password-objektet länkades inte"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A 1Password reference names a vault and an item, like op://Private/staging-admin. Do not include a field.": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En 1Password-referens anger ett valv och ett objekt, som op://Private/staging-admin. Ta inte med något fält."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow Until I Quit": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tillåt tills jag avslutar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@\n\nYou keep a test credential for %@. Threading can stop asking about submissions there until you quit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@\n\nDu har en testinloggning för %@. Threading kan sluta fråga om inskickningar där tills du avslutar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask Again": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fråga igen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Forms submit here without asking. This lasts until you quit Threading and is never written to disk.": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Formulär skickas in här utan att fråga. Det gäller tills du avslutar Threading och sparas aldrig på disk."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Compact Tree": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Kompakt träd"}}}},
    "Starts every sidebar row at the same edge, separating projects with spacing and a rule instead of indentation.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Låter varje rad i sidofältet börja vid samma kant och skiljer projekt åt med luft och en linje i stället för indrag."}}}},
    "Compact tree": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Kompakt träd"}}}},
    "Every sidebar row starts at the same edge. Projects separate with spacing and a rule instead of indentation.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Varje rad i sidofältet börjar vid samma kant. Projekt skiljs åt med luft och en linje i stället för indrag."}}}},
    "compact tree": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "kompakt träd"}}}},
    "indentation": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "indrag"}}}},
    "sidebar density": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "sidofältets täthet"}}}},
    "Session stopped at its usage limit": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Sessionen stoppades vid sin användningsgräns"}}}},
    "Stopped · usage limit reached": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Stoppad · användningsgränsen nådd"}}}},
    "Stopped · usage limit resets %@": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Stoppad · användningsgränsen återställs %@"}}}},
    "Usage limit reached": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Användningsgränsen nådd"}}}},
    "Threading has quit unexpectedly more than once, so its open session and browser windows were not reopened.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Threading har avslutats oväntat mer än en gång, så dess öppna sessions- och webbläsarfönster öppnades inte igen."}}}},
    "Oldest First": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Äldsta först"}}}},
    "Newest First": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Nyaste först"}}}},
    "Most Recent First": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Senast aktiva först"}}}},
    "Least Recent First": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Äldst aktiva först"}}}},
    "A to Z": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "A till Ö"}}}},
    "Z to A": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ö till A"}}}},
    "Applying the theme": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Tillämpar temat"}}}},
    "Building the window": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Bygger fönstret"}}}},
    "Continue in Recovery Mode": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Fortsätt i återställningsläge"}}}},
    "Create Support Report…": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Skapa supportrapport…"}}}},
    "Disable Extensions for Next Launch": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Stäng av tillägg vid nästa start"}}}},
    "Extensions Will Stay Off Next Launch": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Tillägg förblir avstängda vid nästa start"}}}},
    "Extensions and their companions stay off for the next launch only.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Tillägg och deras följeslagare är avstängda endast vid nästa start."}}}},
    "Extensions did not start this launch. They start again the next time Threading opens.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Tillägg startades inte den här gången. De startar igen nästa gång Threading öppnas."}}}},
    "Forgets the window size, the sidebar width and the panel widths.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Glömmer fönstrets storlek, sidofältets bredd och panelernas bredd."}}}},
    "If it keeps happening": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Om det fortsätter hända"}}}},
    "Move App Data Aside…": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Flytta undan appdata…"}}}},
    "Moves your projects, sessions and settings into a dated folder you can put back.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Flyttar dina projekt, sessioner och inställningar till en datummärkt mapp som du kan lägga tillbaka."}}}},
    "Open Extensions Settings": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Öppna inställningar för tillägg"}}}},
    "Opening your projects": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Öppnar dina projekt"}}}},
    "Reading the old data folder": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Läser den gamla datamappen"}}}},
    "Recovery Mode": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Återställningsläge"}}}},
    "Reset Window Layout": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Återställ fönsterlayout"}}}},
    "Restoring your session": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Återställer din session"}}}},
    "Reveal Crash Report": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Visa kraschrapport"}}}},
    "Running normally": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Kör normalt"}}}},
    "Show Options": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Visa alternativ"}}}},
    "Showing recovery mode": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Visar återställningsläge"}}}},
    "Showing the window": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Visar fönstret"}}}},
    "Starting extensions": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Startar tillägg"}}}},
    "Starting the tool listener": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Startar verktygslyssnaren"}}}},
    "The last launch stopped after: %@": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Den senaste starten stannade efter: %@"}}}},
    "The last launch stopped before it recorded anything.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Den senaste starten stannade innan den hann anteckna något."}}}},
    "The recovery launch did not come back either, so nothing automatic has been started.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Återställningsstarten kom inte tillbaka den heller, så inget automatiskt har startats."}}}},
    "This session stays closed until Threading starts normally.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Den här sessionen förblir stängd tills Threading startar normalt."}}}},
    "Threading has quit unexpectedly more than once, so it started in recovery mode.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Threading har avslutats oväntat mer än en gång, så det startade i återställningsläge."}}}},
    "Threading is in recovery mode.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Threading är i återställningsläge."}}}},
    "Threading started in recovery mode.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Threading startade i återställningsläge."}}}},
    "Threading was started with the recovery flag.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Threading startades med återställningsflaggan."}}}},
    "Try Normal Launch Once": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Prova en normal start"}}}},
    "Writes a share-safe diagnostics file and reveals it.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Skriver en delningssäker diagnosfil och visar den."}}}},
    "You held Option at launch, so Threading started in recovery mode.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Du höll ned alt vid start, så Threading startade i återställningsläge."}}}},
    "Recovery mode is showing the stock appearance. Your saved theme is still %@.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Återställningsläget visar standardutseendet. Ditt sparade tema är fortfarande %@."}}}},
    "Cannot Import Classic Skin": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Det går inte att importera det klassiska skalet"}}}},
    "Classic skins": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Klassiska skal"}}}},
    "Import Classic Skin": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Importera klassiskt skal"}}}},
    "Import a classic Winamp .wsz skin, or drop one on this page. Files stay on this Mac.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Importera ett klassiskt Winamp-skal i .wsz-format eller släpp ett på den här sidan. Filerna stannar på denna Mac."}}}},
    "Import…": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Importera…"}}}},
    "Choose a classic .wsz skin file.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Välj en klassisk skalfil i .wsz-format."}}}},
    "Encrypted skin archives are not supported.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Krypterade skalarkiv stöds inte."}}}},
    "Imported Classic Skin": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Importerat klassiskt skal"}}}},
    "Imported classic .wsz window skin. Stored only on this Mac.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Importerat klassiskt .wsz-fönsterskal. Sparas endast på denna Mac."}}}},
    "The expanded skin is too large to import safely.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Det uppackade skalet är för stort för att importeras säkert."}}}},
    "The skin archive is too large to import.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Skalarkivet är för stort för att importeras."}}}},
    "The skin artwork could not be stored.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Skalets grafik kunde inte sparas."}}}},
    "The skin contains too many files.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Skalet innehåller för många filer."}}}},
    "The skin does not contain TITLEBAR.BMP.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Skalet innehåller inte TITLEBAR.BMP."}}}},
    "The skin is not a valid ZIP archive.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Skalet är inte ett giltigt ZIP-arkiv."}}}},
    "The skin uses an unsupported ZIP compression method.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Skalet använder en ZIP-komprimeringsmetod som inte stöds."}}}},
    "The skin's TITLEBAR image could not be read.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Skalets TITLEBAR-bild kunde inte läsas."}}}},
    "The skin's TITLEBAR image is too large (%lld×%lld).": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Skalets TITLEBAR-bild är för stor (%lld×%lld)."}}}},
    "The skin's TITLEBAR image is too small (%lld×%lld).": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Skalets TITLEBAR-bild är för liten (%lld×%lld)."}}}},
    "Conversation Speed": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Konversationshastighet"}}}},
    "Claude sessions start in": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Claude-sessioner startar i"}}}},
    "Codex sessions start in": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Codex-sessioner startar i"}}}},
    "Applies to Terminal and Native chats. Agent's Setting preserves Claude Code's own choice; Fast uses more credits and works only with supported models.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Gäller för Terminal- och Native-chattar. Agentens inställning bevarar Claude Codes eget val; Snabb använder fler krediter och fungerar bara med modeller som stöds."}}}},
    "Applies to Terminal and Native chats. Agent's Setting preserves Codex's own service tier; Fast uses more credits.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Gäller för Terminal- och Native-chattar. Agentens inställning bevarar Codex egen servicenivå; Snabb använder fler krediter."}}}},
    "conversation speed": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "konversationshastighet"}}}},
    "credits": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "krediter"}}}},
    "fast mode": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "snabbläge"}}}},
    "service tier": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "servicenivå"}}}},
    "standard mode": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "standardläge"}}}},
    "Follow General Setting": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Följ inställningen i Allmänt"}}}},
    "Uses the Conversation Speed choice in General settings.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Använder valet Konversationshastighet i inställningarna under Allmänt."}}}},
    "This chat keeps the speed it is running with. The agent's own setting applies the next time it starts.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Den här chatten behåller hastigheten den körs med. Agentens egen inställning gäller nästa gång den startas."}}}},
    "Attachment actions": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Åtgärder för bilaga"}}}},
    "This file could not be previewed.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Filen kunde inte förhandsvisas."}}}},
    "Images, documents, archives, and HTML from this session will appear here.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Bilder, dokument, arkiv och HTML från den här sessionen visas här."}}}},
    "Attachments this session exchanged appear here: images, PDFs, documents, and archives you send, and ones the agent shows or names.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Bilagor som den här sessionen har utbytt visas här: bilder, PDF:er, dokument och arkiv du skickar, och de som agenten visar eller nämner."}}}},
    "%lld files selected": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%lld filer markerade"}}}},
    "Copy Files": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Kopiera filer"}}}},
    "Add attachments to chat": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Lägg till bilagor i chatten"}}}},
    "Images, documents, archives, diagrams, and HTML from this session will appear here.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Bilder, dokument, arkiv, diagram och HTML från den här sessionen visas här."}}}},
    "Attachments this session exchanged appear here: images, PDFs, documents, archives, and diagrams you send, and ones the agent shows or names.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Bilagor som den här sessionen har utbytt visas här: bilder, PDF:er, dokument, arkiv och diagram du skickar, och de som agenten visar eller nämner."}}}},
    "No data to compare": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Inga data att jämföra"}}}},
    "Close Settings": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Stäng inställningarna"}}}},
    "Restore Name & Icon": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Återställ namn och ikon"}}}},
    "Restore this account's detected name and provider icon": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Återställ kontots upptäckta namn och leverantörsikon"}}}},
    "SplitButtonView": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "SplitButtonView"}}}},
    "The same weld for a titled press on the pane's ground — a neutral secondary and its menu chevron. A primary cannot weld: its accent against the chevron's neutral would be a permanent seam.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Samma svetsning för ett tryck med titel på panelens egen grund — en neutral sekundär och dess menypil. En primär kan inte svetsas: dess accent mot pilens neutrala yta skulle bli en permanent skarv."}}}},
    "Alert sound": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Aviseringsljud"}}}},
    "Picking one plays it. Add a Sound copies a sound file into your Sounds folder, where macOS looks for it.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Att välja ett spelar upp det. Lägg till ljud kopierar en ljudfil till din Sounds-mapp, där macOS letar efter den."}}}},
    "macOS Alert Sound": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "macOS aviseringsljud"}}}},
    "Add a Sound…": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Lägg till ljud…"}}}},
    "Choose a sound. Anything past 30 seconds is cut short.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Välj ett ljud. Allt efter 30 sekunder klipps bort."}}}},
    "macOS plays AIFF, WAV and CAF notification sounds. This file is %@.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "macOS spelar upp aviseringsljud i AIFF, WAV och CAF. Den här filen är %@."}}}},
    "in another format": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "i ett annat format"}}}},
    "This file could not be read as a sound.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Filen kunde inte läsas som ett ljud."}}}},
    "The sound could not be copied to your Sounds folder. %@": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ljudet kunde inte kopieras till din Sounds-mapp. %@"}}}},
    "Too many sounds of that name are already there.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "För många ljud med det namnet finns redan där."}}}},
    "Bell sound": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ljudsignal"}}}},
    "Terminal Bell": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Terminalens ljudsignal"}}}},
    "What a program's bell does. Picking one plays it. Off still marks the session in the sidebar, so a silenced bell is seen rather than missed.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Vad ett programs ljudsignal gör. Att välja en spelar upp den. Av markerar fortfarande sessionen i sidofältet, så en tystad signal syns i stället för att missas."}}}},
    "bell": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ljudsignal"}}}},
    "beep": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "pip"}}}},
    "terminal bell": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "terminalens ljudsignal"}}}},
    "alert sound": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "aviseringsljud"}}}},
    "What a blocked approval carries, and an update an agent sends you. The other alerts stay silent. Picking one plays it. Add a Sound copies a sound file into your Sounds folder, where macOS looks for it.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Vad ett blockerat godkännande bär med sig, och en uppdatering som en agent skickar dig. Övriga aviseringar förblir tysta. Att välja ett spelar upp det. Lägg till ljud kopierar en ljudfil till din Sounds-mapp, där macOS letar efter den."}}}},
    "Silence Sounds": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Tysta ljud"}}}},
    "Silence every sound Threading makes": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Tysta varje ljud Threading gör"}}}},
    "Sounds are silenced — banners and marks are unaffected": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ljuden är tystade — aviseringar och markeringar påverkas inte"}}}},
    "Silence": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Tystnad"}}}},
    "Silence every sound": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Tysta varje ljud"}}}},
    "Holds every sound Threading makes — notification alerts and the terminal bell alike — without changing what either is set to; switching it off gives both back exactly what they had. Nothing is suppressed: banners still arrive and the sidebar still marks the session, quietly. The speaker at the sidebar's foot is the same switch.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Håller tillbaka varje ljud Threading gör — både aviseringsljud och terminalens ljudsignal — utan att ändra vad någon av dem är inställd på; när det stängs av får båda tillbaka precis det de hade. Ingenting undertrycks: aviseringar kommer fortfarande fram och sidofältet markerar fortfarande sessionen, fast tyst. Högtalaren längst ned i sidofältet är samma knapp."}}}},
    "Holds every sound Threading makes — notification alerts and the terminal bell alike — without changing what either is set to.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Håller tillbaka varje ljud Threading gör — både aviseringsljud och terminalens ljudsignal — utan att ändra vad någon av dem är inställd på."}}}},
    "silence": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "tysta"}}}},
    "silence sounds": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "tysta ljud"}}}},
    "Inherit": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ärv"}}}},
    "Sounds": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ljud"}}}},
    "Customize…": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Anpassa…"}}}},
    "Customize (%lld Event)…": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Anpassa (%lld händelse)…"}}}},
    "Customize (%lld Events)…": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Anpassa (%lld händelser)…"}}}},
    "Bells": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ljudsignaler"}}}},
    "Silent": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Tyst"}}}},
    "Sounds — %@": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ljud — %@"}}}},
    "What every chat, checkout and terminal starts from. Anything that has answered for itself keeps its own answer.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Det varje chatt, utcheckning och terminal utgår från. Allt som har svarat för egen del behåller sitt eget svar."}}}},
    "This checkout's chats and terminals follow these unless they answer for themselves.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Den här utcheckningens chattar och terminaler följer dessa om de inte svarar för egen del."}}}},
    "This conversation only. Anything left inheriting follows its checkout, then the app.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Endast den här konversationen. Allt som lämnas ärvande följer sin utcheckning och därefter appen."}}}},
    "This terminal only. It keeps no record of why a bell rang, so the bell rows below apply to every bell it makes.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Endast den här terminalen. Den för ingen anteckning om varför en ljudsignal ljöd, så raderna för ljudsignaler nedan gäller varje signal den gör."}}}},
    "All bells": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Alla ljudsignaler"}}}},
    "All notifications": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Alla aviseringar"}}}},
    "The agent rings while you're away": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Agenten ringer medan du är borta"}}}},
    "Rings while you're watching": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ringer medan du tittar"}}}},
    "Rings during a launch": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ringer under en start"}}}},
    "Another program rings": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ett annat program ringer"}}}},
    "Finished or asked while you were away": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Klar eller frågade medan du var borta"}}}},
    "Finished in the background": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Klar i bakgrunden"}}}},
    "The agent sends an update": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Agenten skickar en uppdatering"}}}},
    "A scheduled message went out": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ett schemalagt meddelande skickades"}}}},
    "Events shown as Silent make no sound anywhere unless given one here — the group and one-click choices never turn them on.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Händelser som visas som Tyst ger inget ljud någonstans om de inte får ett här — grupp- och ettklicksvalen slår aldrig på dem."}}}},
    "Default (%@)": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Standard (%@)"}}}},
    "Reset All to Default": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Återställ allt till standard"}}}},
    "Reset All to Inherited": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Återställ allt till ärvt"}}}},
    "Sounds for each alert": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ljud för varje avisering"}}}},
    "Give one alert its own sound — or silence one — without changing the rest. The same sheet a chat or a checkout opens, at the app's own scope.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ge en avisering ett eget ljud — eller tysta en — utan att ändra de övriga. Samma ark som en chatt eller en utcheckning öppnar, fast i appens eget omfång."}}}},
    "Customize Events…": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Anpassa händelser…"}}}},
    "Sounds for each bell": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ljud för varje ljudsignal"}}}},
    "Tell the reasons a bell rings apart: an agent asking while you are away, a bell in the session you are watching, one during a launch, and one from another program.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Skilj på anledningarna till att en ljudsignal ljuder: en agent som frågar medan du är borta, en signal i sessionen du tittar på, en under en start, och en från ett annat program."}}}},
    "Custom Sounds": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Egna ljud"}}}},
    "Sounds you add are copied into ~/Library/Sounds, which is macOS's folder rather than Threading's: anything installed there also appears in System Settings' alert-sound list, and removing a file there removes it from both.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ljud du lägger till kopieras till ~/Library/Sounds, som är macOS mapp och inte Threadings: allt som installeras där syns även i listan över varningsljud i Systeminställningar, och att ta bort en fil där tar bort den från båda."}}}},
    "Nothing overrides these sounds": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Inget åsidosätter de här ljuden"}}}},
    "A chat, a checkout or a terminal given a sound of its own from its Sounds menu is listed here.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "En chatt, en utcheckning eller en terminal som fått ett eget ljud från sin Ljud-meny listas här."}}}},
    "%lld more page matches": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%lld ytterligare sida matchar"}}}},
    "%lld more pages match": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%lld ytterligare sidor matchar"}}}},
    "%lld more scope carries a sound": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%lld ytterligare omfång bär ett ljud"}}}},
    "%lld more scopes carry a sound": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%lld ytterligare omfång bär ett ljud"}}}},
    "Reset All clears every one of them.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Återställ allt rensar var och en av dem."}}}},
    "Every custom sound": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Alla egna ljud"}}}},
    "Puts every chat, checkout and terminal back to what it inherits. The app's own sounds above are untouched.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Återställer varje chatt, utcheckning och terminal till det den ärver. Appens egna ljud ovan lämnas orörda."}}}},
    "Chat in %@": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Chatt i %@"}}}},
    "Terminal in %@": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Terminal i %@"}}}},
    "%@: %@": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%@: %@"}}}},
    "%lld event": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%lld händelse"}}}},
    "%lld events": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%lld händelser"}}}},
    "Set by a later version": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Angivet av en senare version"}}}},
    "Sounds: %@ (this chat)": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ljud: %@ (den här chatten)"}}}},
    "Sounds: %@ (this project)": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ljud: %@ (det här projektet)"}}}},
    "Sounds: %@ (this terminal)": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ljud: %@ (den här terminalen)"}}}},
    "custom sounds": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "egna ljud"}}}},
    "per-event sounds": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ljud per händelse"}}}},
    "customize events": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "anpassa händelser"}}}},
    "override": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "åsidosättning"}}}},
    "Show or Hide the Display Panel": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Visa eller dölj visningspanelen"}}}},
    "A reported text/background pair shown touching, for the diagnostic that has to say two colours are the same colour. Nothing is drawn between the halves: the third sample is one white on the same white, and it has to read as one field with its specimen gone.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ett rapporterat text-/bakgrundspar visat kant i kant, för diagnostiken som måste säga att två färger är samma färg. Ingenting ritas mellan halvorna: det tredje provet är ett vitt på samma vitt, och det måste läsas som ett enda fält med sitt provexemplar borta."}}}},
    "ColorPairSpecimenView": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ColorPairSpecimenView"}}}},
    "Available in Cursor's own terminal; not available in native Chat yet": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Tillgängligt i Cursors egen terminal men ännu inte i inbyggd chatt"}}}},
    "Xcode derived data": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Xcode-byggdata"}}}},
    "Build output your projects can make again — Rust and Swift build directories, installed packages, caches. Worktrees are included, which is usually where most of it is hiding. Temporary locations are scanned too, since that is where an agent builds when it is not building in a project.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Byggutdata som dina projekt kan skapa igen – byggkataloger för Rust och Swift, installerade paket och cachefiler. Worktrees ingår, eftersom det ofta är där det mesta finns. Tillfälliga platser genomsöks också, eftersom det är där en agent bygger när den inte bygger i ett projekt."}}}},
    "Only directories git ignores and a known tool can rebuild are offered. Anything tracked in a repository is left alone, whatever it is called — and ignored files that are not build output, such as .env files, are never touched. In a temporary location a build cache is offered only when Xcode's own manifest identifies it, never an agent's working copy of a repository. Removal is immediate rather than moved to the Trash, since space in the Trash has not been reclaimed.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Endast kataloger som git ignorerar och som ett känt verktyg kan återskapa visas. Allt som spåras i ett kodförråd lämnas orört, oavsett namn. Ignorerade filer som inte är byggutdata, till exempel .env-filer, rörs aldrig. På en tillfällig plats erbjuds en byggcache bara när Xcodes eget manifest identifierar den, aldrig en agents arbetskopia av ett kodförråd. Borttagning sker direkt i stället för via Papperskorgen, eftersom utrymmet annars inte frigörs."}}}},
    "build cache in /tmp": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "byggcache i /tmp"}}}},
    "Left over from deleted workspaces": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Kvar från borttagna arbetsytor"}}}},
    "Other build caches in temporary locations": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Andra byggcacher på tillfälliga platser"}}}},
    "Other ways to send": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Andra sätt att skicka"}}}},
    "Send to Outbox": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Spara i utkorgen"}}}},
    "Screenshot Report": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Skärmbildsrapport"}}}},
    "Report Outbox": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Rapportutkorg"}}}},
    "%@ (%lld)": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%@ (%lld)"}}}},
    "Saved to your outbox (%lld).": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Sparad i din utkorg (%lld)."}}}},
    "The crash summary is in your outbox on this Mac.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Kraschsammanfattningen ligger i din utkorg på den här datorn."}}}},
    "built for %@": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "byggd för %@"}}}},
    "built for %@, which no longer exists": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "byggd för %@, som inte längre finns"}}}},
    "Show Full Command": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Visa hela kommandot"}}}},
    "Program: %@": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Program: %@"}}}},
    "Started %@": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Startad %@"}}}},
    "Working directory: %@": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Arbetskatalog: %@"}}}},
    "%@ · process %lld": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%@ · process %lld"}}}},
    "Port %lld · %@": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Port %lld · %@"}}}},
    "Stop %@": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Stoppa %@"}}}},
    "Stop %@?": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Stoppa %@?"}}}},
    "Process %lld receives a terminate signal. The session itself keeps running.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Processen %lld får en avslutningssignal. Själva sessionen fortsätter att köra."}}}},
    "PanelListView": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "PanelListView"}}}},
    "CompoundValueLabel": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "CompoundValueLabel"}}}},
    "The display panel's list vocabulary — sections, notes and full-width rows on one ink column, the geometry the Info and Sharing panes share instead of each stating their own insets.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Visningspanelens listvokabulär — sektioner, noteringar och rader i full bredd på en gemensam bläckkolumn; geometrin som Info- och Delningspanelerna delar i stället för att var och en anger sina egna indrag."}}}},
    "The same rule for plain segments — the info panel's CPU · memory reading: both parts, then one complete part, then nothing, never a number whose unit went missing.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Samma regel för enkla segment — infopanelens CPU · minnes-avläsning: båda delarna, sedan en komplett del, sedan ingenting, aldrig ett tal vars enhet försvunnit."}}}},
    "ThemedActionPopoverViewController": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ThemedActionPopoverViewController"}}}},
    "The anatomy inside a hover popover: a bounded preview, one group rule, and full-cell action rows.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Anatomin inuti en hovringspopover: en avgränsad förhandsvisning, en gruppregel och åtgärdsrader i full bredd."}}}},
    "HoverTrackingView": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "HoverTrackingView"}}}},
    "Reports the pointer arriving and leaving without drawing anything, so a surface can count the crossing onto it as staying.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Rapporterar när pekaren kommer och lämnar utan att rita något, så att en yta kan räkna övergången till den som att pekaren stannar."}}}},
    "Open in Finder": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Visa i Finder"}}}},
    "Copy image": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Kopiera bild"}}}},
    "Remove attachment": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ta bort bilaga"}}}},
    "The pointer is elsewhere": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Pekaren är någon annanstans"}}}},
    "The pointer is on this surface": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Pekaren är på den här ytan"}}}},
    "Watch %@": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Bevaka %@"}}}},
    "Keep %1$@ under %2$@": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Håll %1$@ under %2$@"}}}},
    "%1$@ has reached %2$@.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%1$@ har nått %2$@."}}}},
    "%1$@ has reached %2$@, the limit you set for this account.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%1$@ har nått %2$@, gränsen du satt för det här kontot."}}}},
    "%1$@ has reached %2$@, on the way to your %3$@ limit.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%1$@ har nått %2$@, på väg mot din gräns på %3$@."}}}},
    "No %@ reading yet.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ingen avläsning av %@ ännu."}}}},
    "This limit was made in a newer version of Threading.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Den här gränsen skapades i en nyare version av Threading."}}}},
    "%1$@ is at %2$@.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%1$@ ligger på %2$@."}}}},
    "%1$@ is at %2$@ of your %3$@ limit.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%1$@ ligger på %2$@ av din gräns på %3$@."}}}},
    "Your Own Limits": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Dina egna gränser"}}}},
    "Tell me when I reach my own limits": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Säg till när jag når mina egna gränser"}}}},
    "A notification when one of your accounts reaches a line you drew. Separate from session notifications, and switched on or off on its own.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "En avisering när ett av dina konton når en gräns du dragit. Skild från aviseringar om chattar och slås på eller av för sig."}}}},
    "Notify me about my own usage limits": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Avisera mig om mina egna användningsgränser"}}}},
    "Add Limit…": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Lägg till gräns…"}}}},
    "Draw a line on this account": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Dra en gräns på det här kontot"}}}},
    "Pick a window and the percentage you want to hear about.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Välj ett fönster och den procentandel du vill höra om."}}}},
    "Tell me when…": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Säg till när…"}}}},
    "No limits": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Inga gränser"}}}},
    "1 limit": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "1 gräns"}}}},
    "%lld limits": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%lld gränser"}}}},
    "This account runs on the provider's own limits.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Det här kontot går på leverantörens egna gränser."}}}},
    "You cleared this account's limits.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Du rensade det här kontots gränser."}}}},
    "It reaches %@": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Det når %@"}}}},
    "Every %@": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Var %@"}}}},
    "A limit here is yours, ahead of the provider's. Today it tells you when a window reaches the line you set — nothing is held back and no session is stopped, and the percentage you are told about is always the one the window itself reads.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "En gräns här är din, före leverantörens. I dag säger den till när ett fönster når gränsen du satt – inget hålls tillbaka och ingen chatt stoppas, och procentandelen du får höra är alltid den som fönstret självt visar."}}}},
    "All Accounts": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Alla konton"}}}},
    "Applies to every login that has no limits of its own": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Gäller varje inloggning som saknar egna gränser"}}}},
    "Set one here and every login without its own limits takes it.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Sätt en här så tar varje inloggning utan egna gränser den."}}}},
    "from All Accounts": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "från Alla konton"}}}},
    "Draw a line on every account": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Dra en gräns på alla konton"}}}},
    "Let this limit colour the usage pill in the toolbar": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Låt den här gränsen färga användningsknappen i verktygsfältet"}}}},
    "Show this limit on the toolbar pill": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Visa den här gränsen på verktygsfältets användningsknapp"}}}},
    "Toolbar": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Verktygsfält"}}}},
    "Your limit": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Din gräns"}}}},
    "Your limit · %@": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Din gräns · %@"}}}},
    "No limit of yours is holding this account.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ingen av dina gränser håller tillbaka det här kontot."}}}},
    "%1$@ is at your %2$@ limit, so Threading is not spending this account on its own.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%1$@ har nått din gräns på %2$@, så Threading spenderar inte det här kontot på egen hand."}}}},
    "Threading cannot read %@ right now, so it is not spending this account on its own.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Threading kan inte läsa %@ just nu, så det spenderar inte det här kontot på egen hand."}}}},
    "Excluded by your limit": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Utesluten av din gräns"}}}},
    "No reading for your limit": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ingen avläsning för din gräns"}}}},
    "…and stop spending it for me": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "… och sluta spendera det åt mig"}}}},
    "…and leave a share for its owner": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "… och lämna en andel till ägaren"}}}},
    "Keep it under %@": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Håll det under %@"}}}},
    "Always leave them %@": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Lämna alltid %@ till dem"}}}},
    "Held at your limit · %@": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Hålls vid din gräns · %@"}}}},
    "%1$@ at %2$@": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%1$@ vid %2$@"}}}},
    "no %@ reading": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ingen avläsning av %@"}}}},
    "Held at your own limit": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Hålls vid din egen gräns"}}}},
    "Held at your own limit · resets %@": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Hålls vid din egen gräns · återställs %@"}}}},
    "Continue Anyway": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Fortsätt ändå"}}}},
    "…and give it a shorter window back": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "… och ge det ett kortare fönster tillbaka"}}}},
    "No more than %1$@ in any %2$@": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Högst %1$@ under %2$@"}}}},
    "No more than %1$@ of %2$@ in any %3$@": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Högst %1$@ av %2$@ under %3$@"}}}},
    "Leave %1$@ of %2$@ for its owner": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Lämna %1$@ av %2$@ till ägaren"}}}},
    "%1$@ spent in the last %2$@, of your %3$@ budget.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%1$@ spenderat de senaste %2$@, av din budget på %3$@."}}}},
    "A limit here is yours, ahead of the provider's. Depending on the one you pick it tells you, holds back what Threading would send on its own, or parks sessions on that account at their next turn. It never stops the keyboard: a turn you type and send goes, whatever your limits say. The percentage you are told about is always the one the window itself reads.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "En gräns här är din, före leverantörens. Beroende på vilken du väljer säger den till, håller tillbaka det Threading skulle skicka på egen hand, eller parkerar chattar på kontot vid nästa tur. Den stoppar aldrig tangentbordet: en tur du skriver och skickar går iväg, oavsett dina gränser. Procentandelen du får höra är alltid den som fönstret självt visar."}}}},
    "Pick a window, then what should happen when it gets there.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Välj ett fönster och vad som ska hända när det når dit."}}}},
    "A manager's virtualized chat row: hover for direct actions or press anywhere to open it.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "En managers virtualiserade chattrad: håll pekaren över den för direkta åtgärder eller tryck var som helst för att öppna den."}}}},
    "A theme-owned heading whose authored line break remains visible and meaningful.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "En temastyrd rubrik vars avsiktliga radbrytning förblir synlig och meningsfull."}}}},
    "SupervisionRowView": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "SupervisionRowView"}}}},
    "ThemedMultilineTitleLabel": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ThemedMultilineTitleLabel"}}}},
    "Use compact title": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Använd kompakt rubrik"}}}},
    "Pairing code unavailable": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Parkopplingskod inte tillgänglig"}}}},
    "The connection is ready, but Threading could not build a pairing code for it. Retrying starts the connection again.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Anslutningen är redo, men Threading kunde inte skapa någon parkopplingskod för den. Ett nytt försök startar anslutningen igen."}}}},
    " · C %d": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": " · C %d"}}}},
    "%d observed changes": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%d observerade ändringar"}}}},
    "%d of %d files": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%d av %d filer"}}}},
    "Bold Text": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Fet text"}}}},
    "Change when it starts": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ändra när den startar"}}}},
    "Changed files only. This runtime reports no reads or edits.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Endast ändrade filer. Den här runtimen rapporterar inga läsningar eller ändringar."}}}},
    "Editing": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Redigerar"}}}},
    "No transcript for this session yet.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Inget transkript för den här sessionen än."}}}},
    "Nothing observed for this session yet.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Inget observerat för den här sessionen än."}}}},
    "Plain marks are files a turn changed with no tool naming them.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Enkla markeringar är filer som en tur ändrade utan att något verktyg namngav dem."}}}},
    "Save changes": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Spara ändringar"}}}},
    "Scheduled session opened for editing.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Schemalagd session öppnad för redigering."}}}},
    "Show or Hide the Sidebar (⌘S)": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Visa eller dölj sidofältet (⌘S)"}}}},
    "This runtime keeps no transcript Threading can read. Files a turn changes appear here once it has run in a git checkout.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Den här runtimen sparar inget transkript som Threading kan läsa. Filer som en tur ändrar visas här när den har körts i en git-utcheckning."}}}},
    "changed": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ändrade"}}}},
    "Configuration": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Konfiguration"}}}},
    "Built": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Byggd"}}}},
    "System": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "System"}}}},
    "Architecture": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Arkitektur"}}}},
    "Version": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Version"}}}},
    "Agent session scratchpad": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Agentsessionens skrivyta"}}}},
    "Allowed by manager.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Tillåten av manager."}}}},
    "Denied by manager.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Nekad av manager."}}}},
    "not rebuilt — the session has ended": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "byggs inte om — sessionen har avslutats"}}}},
    "Let agents see reclaimable build output, suggest more of it, and propose removing some.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Låt agenter se återvinningsbar byggdata, föreslå mer av den och föreslå att ta bort delar av den."}}}},
    "StorageProposalOutlineView": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "StorageProposalOutlineView"}}}},
    "What a cleanup proposal actually says, folded twice: by the heading a directory belongs to, then by the path segments its rows share. A level naming one thing is an indent rather than a line of its own, and a branch carries the total underneath it without being counted as a directory. The two notes that change the decision — something writing there now, and the workspace a cache was built for — sit beside the rows that carry them.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Vad ett städförslag faktiskt säger, vikt två gånger: efter rubriken en katalog hör till, sedan efter de sökvägssegment dess rader delar. En nivå som namnger en enda sak är ett indrag snarare än en egen rad, och en gren bär summan under sig utan att räknas som en katalog. De två noteringarna som ändrar beslutet — att något skriver där just nu, och vilket arbetsområde en cache byggdes för — står intill raderna som bär dem."}}}},
    "Move to the login with the most room and carry on": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Byt till inloggningen med mest utrymme och fortsätt"}}}},
    "Move to %@ and carry on": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Byt till %@ och fortsätt"}}}},
    "Threading stops the agent, moves the conversation to a login with room, and queues “continue” there. A login whose fresh reading has no room is refused rather than used.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Threading stoppar agenten, flyttar konversationen till en inloggning med utrymme och köar ”fortsätt” där. En inloggning vars färska mätning saknar utrymme nekas i stället för att användas."}}}},
    "This conversation has already moved between logins several times just now.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Den här konversationen har redan flyttats mellan inloggningar flera gånger nyss."}}}},
    "This conversation has conflicting automatic recovery schedules.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Den här konversationen har motstridiga automatiska återställningsscheman."}}}},
    "The login this chat was set to continue on is not available.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Inloggningen som chatten skulle fortsätta på är inte tillgänglig."}}}},
    "No other login has room right now.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ingen annan inloggning har utrymme just nu."}}}},
    "There is no other login to move this conversation to.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Det finns ingen annan inloggning att flytta konversationen till."}}}},
    "When the Limit Is Reached": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "När gränsen nås"}}}},
    "Stop and Wait for Me": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Stanna och vänta på mig"}}}},
    "Continue on the Best Login": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Fortsätt på bästa inloggningen"}}}},
    "Moves to a login with room": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Flyttar till en inloggning med utrymme"}}}},
    "Moves to %@": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Flyttar till %@"}}}},
    "%@ closed before confirming the login. Nothing was registered.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%@ avslutades innan inloggningen bekräftades. Ingenting registrerades."}}}},
    "%@ could not verify this login. Try the browser flow again.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%@ kunde inte verifiera den här inloggningen. Försök med webbläsarflödet igen."}}}},
    "%@ is not available on your login shell's PATH. Install it, then try again.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%@ finns inte i din inloggningsskals-PATH. Installera det och försök igen."}}}},
    "%@ is ready": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%@ är redo"}}}},
    "%@ opens its own secure browser sign-in. Threading never sees the credential.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%@ öppnar sin egen säkra webbläsarinloggning. Threading ser aldrig inloggningsuppgiften."}}}},
    "%@ verified the login. It is now available for new sessions.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%@ verifierade inloggningen. Den är nu tillgänglig för nya sessioner."}}}},
    "%lld–%lld of %lld items": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%lld–%lld av %lld objekt"}}}},
    "%lld–%lld of %lld": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%lld–%lld av %lld"}}}},
    "A local label for menus and the isolated provider folder.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "En lokal etikett för menyer och den isolerade leverantörsmappen."}}}},
    "A login named %@ already exists. Reconnect it from Settings ▸ Accounts, or choose another name.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "En inloggning med namnet %@ finns redan. Återanslut den i Inställningar ▸ Konton eller välj ett annat namn."}}}},
    "Add %@": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Lägg till %@"}}}},
    "Add a login": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Lägg till en inloggning"}}}},
    "Add and reconnect logins with the provider's own secure browser flow; Threading stores only the isolated config location, never a credential. Existing Claude and Codex config directories are still found automatically. Click an icon or rename a login to tell them apart. Switch one off to stop offering it for new sessions — nothing is deleted, and sessions already running on it keep working.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Lägg till och återanslut inloggningar med leverantörens eget säkra webbläsarflöde; Threading lagrar bara den isolerade konfigurationsplatsen, aldrig en inloggningsuppgift. Befintliga Claude- och Codex-konfigurationsmappar hittas fortfarande automatiskt. Klicka på en ikon eller byt namn på en inloggning för att skilja dem åt. Stäng av en för att sluta erbjuda den för nya sessioner — ingenting raderas och sessioner som redan körs fortsätter att fungera."}}}},
    "Add or Reconnect": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Lägg till eller återanslut"}}}},
    "Available logins": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Tillgängliga inloggningar"}}}},
    "Complete %@'s sign-in there to reconnect this login.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Slutför %@s inloggning där för att återansluta den här inloggningen."}}}},
    "Complete %@'s sign-in there. Threading will verify this login when the browser flow returns.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Slutför %@s inloggning där. Threading verifierar inloggningen när webbläsarflödet återvänder."}}}},
    "Enter a name containing at least one letter or number.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ange ett namn som innehåller minst en bokstav eller siffra."}}}},
    "Complete sign-in in your browser": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Slutför inloggningen i webbläsaren"}}}},
    "Installation Guide": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Installationsguide"}}}},
    "Login name": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Inloggningsnamn"}}}},
    "No agent accounts yet. Set up one to get started.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Inga agentkonton än. Konfigurera ett för att komma igång."}}}},
    "No agent logins yet. Set up Claude Code or Codex, then finish the provider's secure browser sign-in.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Inga agentinloggningar än. Konfigurera Claude Code eller Codex och slutför sedan leverantörens säkra webbläsarinloggning."}}}},
    "Page %lld of %lld": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Sida %lld av %lld"}}}},
    "Preparing attachments…": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Förbereder bilagor…"}}}},
    "Reconnect": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Återanslut"}}}},
    "Rows %lld–%lld of %lld · columns %lld–%lld of %lld": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Rader %lld–%lld av %lld · kolumner %lld–%lld av %lld"}}}},
    "Run this provider's secure sign-in again": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Kör leverantörens säkra inloggning igen"}}}},
    "Set Up": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Konfigurera"}}}},
    "Set up your agent logins": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Konfigurera dina agentinloggningar"}}}},
    "Showing the first %lld diff lines. Export the comparison for the complete diff.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Visar de första %lld diff-raderna. Exportera jämförelsen för hela diffen."}}}},
    "Sign In": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Logga in"}}}},
    "Sign-in did not finish": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Inloggningen slutfördes inte"}}}},
    "Signing in": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Loggar in"}}}},
    "The browser sign-in timed out. Nothing was registered.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Webbläsarinloggningen tog för lång tid. Ingenting registrerades."}}}},
    "Threading could not prepare an isolated provider folder for this login.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Threading kunde inte förbereda en isolerad leverantörsmapp för den här inloggningen."}}}},
    "Threading could not start %@.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Threading kunde inte starta %@."}}}},
    "Use a login already on this Mac, or add one here. The provider's own CLI handles the secure browser sign-in and keeps the credential.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Använd en inloggning som redan finns på denna Mac eller lägg till en här. Leverantörens eget CLI hanterar den säkra webbläsarinloggningen och behåller inloggningsuppgiften."}}}},
    "Use another ChatGPT account with Codex.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Använd ett annat ChatGPT-konto med Codex."}}}},
    "Use another Claude subscription or organization.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Använd en annan Claude-prenumeration eller organisation."}}}},
    "Work or Personal": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Arbete eller privat"}}}},
    "A successor is announced and not in use yet: %@. Every device that has connected since then already trusts it.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "En efterträdare är aviserad och används inte än: %@. Varje enhet som har anslutit sedan dess litar redan på den."}}}},
    "Activate Rotation": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Aktivera rotation"}}}},
    "After a restart": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Efter en omstart"}}}},
    "Also reachable at %@.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Går också att nå på %@."}}}},
    "anyone on the VPN who has your pairing code": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "alla på VPN:et som har din parkopplingskod"}}}},
    "anyone on this network who has your pairing code": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "alla i det här nätverket som har din parkopplingskod"}}}},
    "Away from home": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Utanför hemmet"}}}},
    "Binding to this Mac’s addresses on this network…": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Binder till Mac-datorns adresser i det här nätverket…"}}}},
    "Binding to this Mac’s tailnet address…": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Binder till den här Mac-datorns tailnet-adress…"}}}},
    "Checked when the tailnet way in is on.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Kontrolleras när vägen in via tailnet är på."}}}},
    "Connect this Mac to Wi-Fi or Ethernet. The door comes back on its own.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Anslut Mac-datorn till Wi-Fi eller Ethernet. Vägen in kommer tillbaka av sig själv."}}}},
    "Connecting to Threading’s service…": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ansluter till Threadings tjänst…"}}}},
    "devices your tailnet ACLs allow": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "enheter som ditt tailnets ACL-regler tillåter"}}}},
    "Every device that has connected to this Mac since the successor was announced keeps working without doing anything. A device that has not connected since then has to scan the new pairing code.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Varje enhet som har anslutit till den här Mac-datorn sedan efterträdaren aviserades fortsätter fungera utan att göra något. En enhet som inte har anslutit sedan dess måste skanna den nya parkopplingskoden."}}}},
    "Install Tailscale and sign in on this Mac. The door comes back on its own.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Installera Tailscale och logga in på den här Mac-datorn. Vägen in kommer tillbaka av sig själv."}}}},
    "Lets a browser on your tailnet open Threading without a certificate warning. The Threading app does not need this.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Låter en webbläsare i ditt tailnet öppna Threading utan certifikatvarning. Threading-appen behöver inte det här."}}}},
    "No successor certificate has been prepared.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Inget efterträdarcertifikat har förberetts."}}}},
    "No way in is switched on": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ingen väg in är påslagen"}}}},
    "No way in": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ingen väg in"}}}},
    "no": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "nej"}}}},
    "nobody outside this network": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ingen utanför det här nätverket"}}}},
    "nobody reads it. Tailscale may relay it encrypted when a direct connection is not possible": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ingen läser den. Tailscale kan vidarebefordra den krypterad när en direktanslutning inte är möjlig"}}}},
    "nobody. A fallback relay carries encrypted data it cannot read": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ingen. Ett reservrelä bär krypterad data som det inte kan läsa"}}}},
    "Not available in this version of Threading.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Inte tillgängligt i den här versionen av Threading."}}}},
    "Not carrying traffic.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Bär ingen trafik."}}}},
    "Not currently reachable: no address on this network.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Går inte att nå just nu: ingen adress i det här nätverket."}}}},
    "Not currently reachable: ports %1$@ to %2$@ are all in use.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Går inte att nå just nu: portarna %1$@ till %2$@ är alla upptagna."}}}},
    "Not currently reachable: Tailscale is not connected.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Går inte att nå just nu: Tailscale är inte anslutet."}}}},
    "Not currently reachable: Tailscale is not installed on this Mac.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Går inte att nå just nu: Tailscale är inte installerat på den här Mac-datorn."}}}},
    "Not currently reachable: this Mac has no certificate to present.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Går inte att nå just nu: den här Mac-datorn har inget certifikat att visa."}}}},
    "Not currently reachable: this Mac is not signed in to Tailscale.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Går inte att nå just nu: den här Mac-datorn är inte inloggad på Tailscale."}}}},
    "Not reachable": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Går inte att nå"}}}},
    "Nothing outside this Mac can reach it right now.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Inget utanför den här Mac-datorn kan nå den just nu."}}}},
    "Nothing to do. It reconnects on its own.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Inget att göra. Den återansluter av sig själv."}}}},
    "Off. A browser on your tailnet gets a certificate warning.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Av. En webbläsare i ditt tailnet får en certifikatvarning."}}}},
    "Off. Nothing on this network can reach this Mac.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Av. Inget i det här nätverket kan nå den här Mac-datorn."}}}},
    "Off. Threading is not published on your tailnet.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Av. Threading publiceras inte i ditt tailnet."}}}},
    "Open in a browser on your tailnet": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Öppna i en webbläsare i ditt tailnet"}}}},
    "Prepare Rotation": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Förbered rotation"}}}},
    "Publishing on your tailnet…": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Publicerar i ditt tailnet…"}}}},
    "Quit whatever is holding them, then turn Remote Access off and on again.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Avsluta det som håller dem och slå sedan av och på Fjärråtkomst igen."}}}},
    "Reach this Mac from anywhere on your tailnet. Needs Tailscale installed and signed in on both devices.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Nå den här Mac-datorn var som helst i ditt tailnet. Kräver att Tailscale är installerat och inloggat på båda enheterna."}}}},
    "Reach this Mac from anywhere, with no VPN. Threading connects the two devices directly when it can, and falls back to a relay when your network will not allow a direct connection.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Nå den här Mac-datorn var som helst, utan VPN. Threading kopplar ihop de två enheterna direkt när det går och faller tillbaka på ett relä när nätverket inte tillåter en direktanslutning."}}}},
    "Reachable at %@": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Går att nå på %@"}}}},
    "Ready. Your signed-in devices can reach this Mac.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Klart. Dina inloggade enheter kan nå den här Mac-datorn."}}}},
    "Remote Access is off.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Fjärråtkomst är av."}}}},
    "Remote Access is on and nothing outside this Mac can reach it. Turn on a way in below. The local mirror is ready on 127.0.0.1:%@.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Fjärråtkomst är på och inget utanför den här Mac-datorn kan nå den. Slå på en väg in nedan. Den lokala spegeln är klar på 127.0.0.1:%@."}}}},
    "Remote Access is on and nothing outside this Mac can reach it. Turn on This network, or Tailscale, to get a pairing code.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Fjärråtkomst är på och inget utanför den här Mac-datorn kan nå den. Slå på Det här nätverket eller Tailscale för att få en parkopplingskod."}}}},
    "Reset Identity": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Återställ identitet"}}}},
    "Reset Identity…": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Återställ identitet…"}}}},
    "Reset this Mac’s identity below. Every paired device has to scan again.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Återställ den här Mac-datorns identitet nedan. Varje parkopplad enhet måste skanna igen."}}}},
    "Reset this Mac’s identity?": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Återställa den här Mac-datorns identitet?"}}}},
    "Serving at %@": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Serverar på %@"}}}},
    "Sign in to Tailscale on this Mac. The door comes back on its own.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Logga in på Tailscale på den här Mac-datorn. Vägen in kommer tillbaka av sig själv."}}}},
    "Starting on your tailnet…": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Startar i ditt tailnet…"}}}},
    "Switch to the new identity?": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Byta till den nya identiteten?"}}}},
    "Switch": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Byt"}}}},
    "the address stays the same": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "adressen är densamma"}}}},
    "The macOS firewall may be blocking Threading; allow it in System Settings ▸ Network ▸ Firewall.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "macOS brandvägg kan blockera Threading. Tillåt appen i Systeminställningar ▸ Nätverk ▸ Brandvägg."}}}},
    "The same connection works over a VPN into this network, including UniFi Teleport and WireGuard. Connect the VPN on your phone first.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Samma anslutning fungerar över ett VPN in i det här nätverket, inklusive UniFi Teleport och WireGuard. Anslut VPN:et på telefonen först."}}}},
    "This Mac has no certificate yet.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Den här Mac-datorn har inget certifikat än."}}}},
    "This Mac mints its certificate the first time a way in needs one.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Den här Mac-datorn skapar sitt certifikat första gången en väg in behöver ett."}}}},
    "This Mac’s certificate file is not a certificate. Resetting the identity mints a new one, and every paired device has to scan again.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Den här Mac-datorns certifikatfil är inte ett certifikat. Att återställa identiteten skapar ett nytt, och varje parkopplad enhet måste skanna igen."}}}},
    "This Mac’s certificate was written by a newer version of Threading. Update Threading rather than resetting the identity, which would unpair every device.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Den här Mac-datorns certifikat skrevs av en nyare version av Threading. Uppdatera Threading i stället för att återställa identiteten, vilket skulle koppla bort varje enhet."}}}},
    "This Mac’s tailnet address": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Den här Mac-datorns tailnet-adress"}}}},
    "This network": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Det här nätverket"}}}},
    "Threading could not mint a certificate on this Mac. Try again, and report it if it keeps failing.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Threading kunde inte skapa ett certifikat på den här Mac-datorn. Försök igen och rapportera det om det fortsätter misslyckas."}}}},
    "Threading could not open the folder its certificate lives in.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Threading kunde inte öppna mappen där certifikatet ligger."}}}},
    "Threading could not read its certificate. Resetting the identity mints a new one, and every paired device has to scan again.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Threading kunde inte läsa sitt certifikat. Att återställa identiteten skapar ett nytt, och varje parkopplad enhet måste skanna igen."}}}},
    "Threading Direct": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Threading Direct"}}}},
    "Threading mints a new certificate and a new pairing code. Every paired device stops trusting this Mac and has to scan the new code before it can connect again. Use Prepare Rotation instead if this Mac’s certificate is still working.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Threading skapar ett nytt certifikat och en ny parkopplingskod. Varje parkopplad enhet slutar lita på den här Mac-datorn och måste skanna den nya koden innan den kan ansluta igen. Använd Förbered rotation i stället om Mac-datorns certifikat fortfarande fungerar."}}}},
    "Threading’s service is temporarily unavailable.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Threadings tjänst är tillfälligt otillgänglig."}}}},
    "Through a VPN": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Via ett VPN"}}}},
    "Turn on Remote Access. Threading starts a local mirror and answers on the ways in you have switched on below.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Slå på Fjärråtkomst. Threading startar en lokal spegel och svarar på de vägar in du har slagit på nedan."}}}},
    "Turn on Tailscale on this Mac. The door comes back on its own.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Slå på Tailscale på den här Mac-datorn. Vägen in kommer tillbaka av sig själv."}}}},
    "Turning it on publishes this Mac’s name and your tailnet name in public certificate logs.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Att slå på det publicerar den här Mac-datorns namn och ditt tailnets namn i offentliga certifikatloggar."}}}},
    "Turning this on does not put Threading on any other network. Each way in above is separate.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Att slå på det här lägger inte Threading på något annat nätverk. Varje väg in ovan är separat."}}}},
    "Ways In": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Vägar in"}}}},
    "Who can reach it": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Vem kan nå den"}}}},
    "Who can see the traffic": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Vem kan se trafiken"}}}},
    "whoever operates the VPN, which is you": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "den som driver VPN:et, vilket är du"}}}},
    "yes, while the VPN is connected": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ja, så länge VPN:et är anslutet"}}}},
    "yes": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ja"}}}},
    "Your phone can run only one VPN at a time, so this and Tailscale cannot both be connected.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Telefonen kan bara köra ett VPN i taget, så det här och Tailscale kan inte vara anslutna samtidigt."}}}},
    "Your phone pins this Mac’s certificate when it scans the pairing code, and compares this code with what answers every time it connects. Nothing else is trusted, so no certificate authority can stand in for this Mac.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Telefonen fäster den här Mac-datorns certifikat när den skannar parkopplingskoden och jämför koden med det som svarar varje gång den ansluter. Inget annat är betrott, så ingen certifikatutfärdare kan träda in i Mac-datorns ställe."}}}},
    "Your phone reaches this Mac when both are on the same Wi-Fi.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Telefonen når den här Mac-datorn när båda är på samma Wi-Fi."}}}},
    "your signed-in devices": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "dina inloggade enheter"}}}},
    "Prepare mints the next certificate and announces it over the connection your devices already trust. Activate switches to it, and a device that has connected since the announcement keeps working.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Förbered skapar nästa certifikat och aviserar det över anslutningen som dina enheter redan litar på. Aktivera byter till det, och en enhet som har anslutit sedan aviseringen fortsätter fungera."}}}},
    "May not be reachable": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Kanske inte går att nå"}}}},
    "Ports %1$@ to %2$@ are all in use on this Mac. Quit whatever is holding them, then turn Remote Access on again.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Portarna %1$@ till %2$@ är alla upptagna på den här Mac-datorn. Avsluta det som håller dem och slå sedan på Fjärråtkomst igen."}}}},
    "Threading could not open its listener on this Mac. Turn Remote Access on again, and report it if it keeps failing.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Threading kunde inte öppna sin lyssnare på den här Mac-datorn. Slå på Fjärråtkomst igen och rapportera det om det fortsätter misslyckas."}}}},
    "ControlButtonGroupView": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ControlButtonGroupView"}}}},
    "The same run inside a content control row rather than a toolbar. The space within a related run is tighter than the space between separate decisions, and the whole run takes the theme's row height in one step — switch the style above and every icon in it follows.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Samma grupp inuti en innehållsrad i stället för i verktygsfältet. Avståndet inom en sammanhörande grupp är tätare än avståndet mellan separata beslut, och hela gruppen tar temats radhöjd i ett steg — byt stil ovan så följer varje ikon med."}}}},
    "ImageAnnotationPaneView": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ImageAnnotationPaneView"}}}},
    "The whole sidecar the inspector hangs beside a picture: the list, how many of the twenty are used, what the chat has already been given, and the one press that gives it the rest. The inspector supplies the pixels and the mutations; the pane owns the layout.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Hela sidopanelen som inspektören hänger bredvid en bild: listan, hur många av de tjugo som används, vad chatten redan har fått, och det enda tryck som ger den resten. Inspektören levererar pixlarna och ändringarna; panelen äger layouten."}}}},
    "ImageAnnotationReceiptView": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ImageAnnotationReceiptView"}}}},
    "What is left where the picture lives once the inspector is closed: how many marks were saved, whether the chat has this revision, and the way back in. Shown beside the source image rather than inside the inspector.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Det som finns kvar där bilden bor när inspektören har stängts: hur många markeringar som sparades, om chatten har den här revisionen, och vägen tillbaka in. Visas bredvid källbilden i stället för inuti inspektören."}}}},
    "ImageAnnotationCountView": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ImageAnnotationCountView"}}}},
    "The same fact at row size, for the attachments chronology — a pin and a number, read as one glance down a column.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Samma sak i radstorlek, för bilagornas kronologi — en nål och en siffra, avläst med en blick nedför en kolumn."}}}},
    "Step back": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Gå bakåt"}}}},
    "Step forward": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Gå framåt"}}}},
    "Added the current revision to the chat.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Lade till den aktuella revisionen i chatten."}}}},
    "Took the revision back out of the chat.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Tog tillbaka revisionen ur chatten."}}}},
    "Reopened the picture for editing.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Öppnade bilden för redigering igen."}}}},
    "Took the receipt's action.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Utförde kvittots åtgärd."}}}},
    "The row loses its highlight before the capture is taken.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Raden tappar sin markering innan bilden tas."}}}},
    "This label wraps one word early at this width.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Den här etiketten bryter raden ett ord för tidigt vid den här bredden."}}}},
    "Announce on this network": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Annonsera i det här nätverket"}}}},
    "Announced as %@": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Annonserad som %@"}}}},
    "Broadcasts an opaque name, this Mac’s id, its protocol version and its certificate fingerprint, so a paired iPhone can find this Mac after its address changes. Never the computer name and never your name, and pairing still needs the code.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Sänder ut ett ogenomskinligt namn, den här Mac-datorns id, dess protokollversion och dess certifikatavtryck, så att en parkopplad iPhone kan hitta Mac-datorn när adressen ändras. Aldrig datornamnet och aldrig ditt namn, och parkoppling kräver fortfarande koden."}}}},
    "Can wake this Mac from sleep": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Kan väcka den här Mac-datorn ur viloläge"}}}},
    "No sleep proxy on this network; an Apple TV or HomePod provides one": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ingen viloproxy i det här nätverket; en Apple TV eller HomePod tillhandahåller en"}}}},
    "Not checked yet": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Inte kontrollerat än"}}}},
    "Wake for network access is off in System Settings ▸ Energy": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Väckning för nätverksåtkomst är avstängd i Systeminställningar ▸ Energi"}}}},
    "Waking needs an announcement on this network": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Väckning kräver en annonsering i det här nätverket"}}}},
    "No agents working": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Inga agenter arbetar"}}}},
    "One agent working": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "En agent arbetar"}}}},
    "%lld agents working": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%lld agenter arbetar"}}}},
    "%@, top effort active": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%@, högsta ansträngning aktiv"}}}},
    "Copy the chart as a picture": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Kopiera diagrammet som bild"}}}},
    "Copy the numbers behind the chart": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Kopiera siffrorna bakom diagrammet"}}}},
    "Curfew at %@": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Spärrtid %@"}}}},
    "Curfew since %@": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Spärrtid sedan %@"}}}},
    "Held by curfew since %@": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Hålls av spärrtid sedan %@"}}}},
    "Exempt from quiet hours": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Undantagen från tysta timmar"}}}},
    "wrap-up sent %@": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "avslutning skickad %@"}}}},
    "interrupted %1$@ ×%2$lld": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "avbruten %1$@ ×%2$lld"}}}},
    "kept working after %lld interrupts": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "fortsatte arbeta efter %lld avbrott"}}}},
    "Kept working after %lld interrupts": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Fortsatte arbeta efter %lld avbrott"}}}},
    "Threading cannot tell whether this session is working, so it only stops delivering messages.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Threading kan inte avgöra om sessionen arbetar, så den slutar bara leverera meddelanden."}}}},
    "This session has been under a curfew since %@, so Threading is not spending it on its own.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Den här sessionen har haft spärrtid sedan %@, så Threading spenderar den inte på egen hand."}}}},
    "Its curfew passed before the session was free.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Spärrtiden passerade innan sessionen blev ledig."}}}},
    "Threading was not running.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Threading kördes inte."}}}},
    "In 3 hours": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Om 3 timmar"}}}},
    "Tonight at %@": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "I kväll %@"}}}},
    "Until the %@ window resets": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Tills %@-fönstret återställs"}}}},
    "At quiet hours (%@)": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Vid tysta timmar (%@)"}}}},
    "Ends this session when the standing quiet hours next begin.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Avslutar sessionen när de tysta timmarna börjar nästa gång."}}}},
    "Ends at %@": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Slutar %@"}}}},
    "No curfew": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ingen spärrtid"}}}},
    "Nothing ends this session; it runs until you stop it.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Inget avslutar sessionen; den kör tills du stoppar den."}}}},
    "Follow quiet hours": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Följ tysta timmar"}}}},
    "Held every night with every other session that has not said otherwise.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Hålls varje natt tillsammans med alla andra sessioner som inte sagt något annat."}}}},
    "Quiet hours never hold this session; it keeps working through them.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Tysta timmar håller aldrig den här sessionen; den fortsätter arbeta genom dem."}}}},
    "Lift Curfew": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Häv spärrtid"}}}},
    "Releases this session now; nothing else about the rule changes.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Släpper sessionen nu; inget annat i regeln ändras."}}}},
    "Until %@": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Till %@"}}}},
    "Until quiet hours": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Till tysta timmar"}}}},
    "Until quiet hours (%@)": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Till tysta timmar (%@)"}}}},
    "Standing down for quiet hours until %@.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Står över för tysta timmar till %@."}}}},
    "The copy holding it is at %@.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Kopian som håller den finns i %@."}}}},
    "Threading is running but not responding": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Threading körs men svarar inte"}}}},
    "The Threading that owns the session state has not answered for %lld seconds. You can end it and start this one instead. Anything it was in the middle of is lost.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Den Threading som äger sessionstillståndet har inte svarat på %lld sekunder. Du kan avsluta den och starta den här i stället. Allt den höll på med går förlorat."}}}},
    "End It and Continue": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Avsluta den och fortsätt"}}}},
    "Threading could not take over the session state": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Threading kunde inte ta över sessionstillståndet"}}}},
    "The other Threading is still holding the state, so this one will quit rather than risk two of them writing to it.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Den andra Threading håller fortfarande tillståndet, så den här avslutas i stället för att riskera att två skriver till det."}}}},
    "Kept working after its curfew": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Fortsatte arbeta efter sin spärrtid"}}}},
    "Stopped after %lld interrupts": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Stoppad efter %lld avbrott"}}}},
    "There was no turn to stop.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Det fanns ingen tur att stoppa."}}}},
    "Threading is not running, but its session state is still locked": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Threading kör inte, men dess sessionstillstånd är fortfarande låst"}}}},
    "A previous Threading did not shut down, and %1$lld of the agent processes it started are still holding the lock on your projects: %2$@. Ending them lets this Threading start. Anything they were in the middle of is lost.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "En tidigare Threading avslutades inte, och %1$lld av agentprocesserna den startade håller fortfarande låset på dina projekt: %2$@. Att avsluta dem låter den här Threading starta. Allt de höll på med går förlorat."}}}},
    "End Them and Continue": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Avsluta dem och fortsätt"}}}},
    "A previous Threading did not shut down and something it started is still holding the lock on your projects. Quitting those processes, or restarting the Mac, lets Threading open again.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "En tidigare Threading avslutades inte och något den startade håller fortfarande låset på dina projekt. Att avsluta de processerna, eller starta om datorn, låter Threading öppnas igen."}}}},
    "Under a curfew": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Under spärrtid"}}}},
    "End this session": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Avsluta sessionen"}}}},
    "Set Curfew": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ange spärrtid"}}}},
    "Curfew lifted.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Spärrtiden hävd."}}}},
    "One ribbon for every standing reason a conversation has stopped. Four provider states first: the offer, the offer with no login to move to, the same offer being carried out, and one that could not be taken. Then three curfews — the user's own line, which wears the conduct mark rather than the triangle, ends with Lift rather than a ✕, and states plainly where Threading cannot tell whether the session is working. The button names the whole action, which is why pressing it asks nothing further.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ett band för varje stående skäl till att ett samtal har stannat. Först fyra leverantörslägen: erbjudandet, erbjudandet utan inloggning att flytta till, samma erbjudande medan det utförs, och ett som inte gick att ta. Sedan tre spärrtider — användarens egen gräns, som bär uppförandemärket i stället för triangeln, avslutas med Häv i stället för ett ✕, och säger rakt ut när Threading inte kan avgöra om sessionen arbetar. Knappen namnger hela sin åtgärd, vilket är varför ett tryck inte frågar något mer."}}}},
    "Curfew": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Spärrtid"}}}},
    "Quiet Hours & Curfews": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Tysta timmar och spärrtider"}}}},
    "A curfew ends a session's spending at a time you choose — from the composer when you start a session, or from a session's menu. Before it, Threading asks the agent to wrap up; at the time it stops sending on its own; after a grace it interrupts whatever is still running. You keep the conversation and can continue it by hand. Quiet hours are a curfew every session follows daily unless it is exempt.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "En spärrtid avslutar en sessions spenderande vid en tid du väljer — från skrivfältet när du startar en session, eller från en sessions meny. Innan den ber Threading agenten att avsluta; vid tidpunkten slutar Threading skicka på egen hand; efter en frist avbryts det som fortfarande körs. Du behåller samtalet och kan fortsätta det för hand. Tysta timmar är en spärrtid som varje session följer dagligen om den inte är undantagen."}}}},
    "Send a wrap-up before the curfew": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Skicka en avslutning före spärrtiden"}}}},
    "Interrupt a turn still running": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Avbryt en tur som fortfarande pågår"}}}},
    "Wrap-up message": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Avslutningsmeddelande"}}}},
    "%@ is replaced by the curfew time.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%@ ersätts med spärrtidens tidpunkt."}}}},
    "If it keeps working after %lld interrupts": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Om den fortsätter arbeta efter %lld avbrott"}}}},
    "Stopping keeps the conversation on screen; Resume Session brings it back.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Att stoppa behåller samtalet på skärmen; Fortsätt konversation hämtar tillbaka det."}}}},
    "Notify me": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Avisera mig"}}}},
    "Stop the agent": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Stoppa agenten"}}}},
    "Quiet hours": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Tysta timmar"}}}},
    "Every session is held between these times unless it is exempt.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Varje session hålls tillbaka mellan dessa tider om den inte är undantagen."}}}},
    "From": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Från"}}}},
    "To": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Till"}}}},
    "Tonight": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "I natt"}}}},
    "%lld minutes before": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%lld minuter före"}}}},
    "Never": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Aldrig"}}}},
    "At the curfew": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Vid spärrtiden"}}}},
    "%lld minutes after": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%lld minuter efter"}}}},
    "Wrap-up at %@": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Avslutning %@"}}}},
    "held from %@": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "hålls tillbaka från %@"}}}},
    "Held from %@": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Hålls tillbaka från %@"}}}},
    "a turn still running at %@ is interrupted": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "en tur som fortfarande pågår %@ avbryts"}}}},
    "%@, then the agent is stopped": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%@, sedan stoppas agenten"}}}},
    "nothing is interrupted": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "inget avbryts"}}}},
    "lifts %@": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "hävs %@"}}}},
    "sends a wrap-up %lld minutes before": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "skickar en avslutning %lld minuter före"}}}},
    "sends no wrap-up": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "skickar ingen avslutning"}}}},
    "interrupts a turn still running %lld minutes after": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "avbryter en tur som fortfarande pågår %lld minuter efter"}}}},
    "interrupts a turn still running at the curfew": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "avbryter en tur som fortfarande pågår vid spärrtiden"}}}},
    "never interrupts a turn still running": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "avbryter aldrig en tur som fortfarande pågår"}}}},
    "%@, then stops the agent": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%@, och stoppar sedan agenten"}}}},
    "Quiet hours are off. A curfew you set on a session %1$@ and %2$@.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Tysta timmar är av. En spärrtid du sätter på en session %1$@ och %2$@."}}}},
    "curfew": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "spärrtid"}}}},
    "quiet hours": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "tysta timmar"}}}},
    "wind-down": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "avslutning"}}}},
    "wrap-up": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "avslutning"}}}},
    "interrupt": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "avbryt"}}}},
    "stop the agent": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "stoppa agenten"}}}},
    "End this session at a time": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Avsluta sessionen vid en tid"}}}},
    "wrap-up at %@": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "avslutning %@"}}}},
    "interrupted after %@": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "avbryts efter %@"}}}},
    "Before the task you write": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Före uppgiften du skriver"}}}},
    "After the task you write": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Efter uppgiften du skriver"}}}},
    "Sent once ahead of the task, framing how this chat should be worked on.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Skickas en gång före uppgiften och ramar in hur chatten ska arbetas med."}}}},
    "Sent once after the task, for a standing instruction about the answer.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Skickas en gång efter uppgiften, för en stående instruktion om svaret."}}}},
    "For example: Think it through before you start changing files.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Till exempel: Tänk igenom det innan du börjar ändra filer."}}}},
    "Both are sent once, inside the first turn of a new chat — side chats and cross-provider continuations included. Neither is sent again when a chat resumes, and an imported conversation receives nothing. The name in the sidebar still comes from the task you wrote.": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Båda skickas en gång, i den första turen i en ny chatt – även sidochattar och fortsättningar hos en annan leverantör. Ingen av dem skickas igen när en chatt återupptas, och en importerad konversation får ingenting. Namnet i sidofältet kommer fortfarande från uppgiften du skrev."}}}},
    "prefix": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "prefix"}}}},
    "prepend": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "lägg till före"}}}},
    "suffix": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "suffix"}}}},
    "append": {"localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "lägg till efter"}}}},
    "“%@” could not be repaired": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "“%@” kunde inte repareras"}}}},
    "%@ could not read this conversation's saved file, so it stopped instead of resuming.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%@ kunde inte läsa den här konversationens sparade fil och stoppade i stället för att återuppta."}}}},
    "%@ could not start": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%@ kunde inte starta"}}}},
    "%@ couldn’t start": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%@ kunde inte starta"}}}},
    "%@ is already using this conversation's identifier somewhere else.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%@ använder redan den här konversationens identifierare någon annanstans."}}}},
    "%@ refused to resume this conversation.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%@ vägrade återuppta den här konversationen."}}}},
    "%@ stopped right after starting.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%@ stoppade direkt efter starten."}}}},
    "A conversation in Threading called “%@” will not reopen. Its agent refused to resume and stopped. Your job is to work out why and, if you can, repair it.\n\nWhat the runtime said:\n\n%@\n\nThreading has already copied the conversation file for you to work on:\n\n  Working copy: %@\n  Original:     %@ (read this if you need to; never write to it)\n\nWork only on the working copy. The original sits in a directory holding every other conversation on this machine, and Threading — not you — will put a repaired file back, keeping a backup, once the user approves it.\n\nWhen you are done, call the %@ tool with the path to your working copy and a plain explanation of what was wrong and what you changed. Call it whether or not you succeeded: a clear account of a conversation that cannot be saved is worth more than silence, and the user is shown what you say before anything is replaced.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "En konversation i Threading som heter “%@” går inte att öppna igen. Dess agent vägrade att återuppta och stoppade. Din uppgift är att ta reda på varför och, om du kan, reparera den.\n\nVad körtiden sa:\n\n%@\n\nThreading har redan kopierat konversationsfilen som du ska arbeta med:\n\n  Arbetskopia: %@\n  Original:    %@ (läs den om du behöver; skriv aldrig till den)\n\nArbeta bara med arbetskopian. Originalet ligger i en katalog som innehåller alla andra konversationer på den här datorn, och Threading — inte du — lägger tillbaka en reparerad fil, med en säkerhetskopia, när användaren har godkänt den.\n\nNär du är klar, anropa verktyget %@ med sökvägen till din arbetskopia och en enkel förklaring av vad som var fel och vad du ändrade. Anropa det oavsett om du lyckades eller inte: en tydlig redogörelse för en konversation som inte kan räddas är värd mer än tystnad, och användaren får se vad du säger innan något ersätts."}}}},
    "Agent: %@": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Agent: %@"}}}},
    "Conversation file: %@": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Konversationsfil: %@"}}}},
    "Conversation repair: %@": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Konversationsreparation: %@"}}}},
    "Conversation: %@": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Konversation: %@"}}}},
    "Copy Details": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Kopiera detaljer"}}}},
    "Couldn’t set up the repair": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Kunde inte förbereda reparationen"}}}},
    "Exit code: %@": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Slutkod: %@"}}}},
    "File: %@": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Fil: %@"}}}},
    "Keep the Original": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Behåll originalet"}}}},
    "Outcome: the original was kept.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Utfall: originalet behölls."}}}},
    "Outcome: the repaired file was accepted.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Utfall: den reparerade filen accepterades."}}}},
    "Recovering %@": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Återställer %@"}}}},
    "Repaired “%@”": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Reparerade “%@”"}}}},
    "Report This…": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Rapportera detta…"}}}},
    "Reported. The user has been shown what you found and asked to decide.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Rapporterat. Användaren har fått se vad du hittade och ombetts besluta."}}}},
    "Reported. The user has been shown what you found.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Rapporterat. Användaren har fått se vad du hittade."}}}},
    "The %@ command was not found on this Mac.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Kommandot %@ hittades inte på den här datorn."}}}},
    "The agent gave no account of what it found.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Agenten lämnade ingen redogörelse för vad den hittade."}}}},
    "The conversation file could not be copied: %@": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Konversationsfilen kunde inte kopieras: %@"}}}},
    "The conversation file is no longer where it was.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Konversationsfilen finns inte längre där den låg."}}}},
    "The end of this conversation's saved file was written without the record numbering Codex needs to reopen it.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Slutet av den här konversationens sparade fil skrevs utan den postnumrering som Codex behöver för att öppna den igen."}}}},
    "The last attempt to open this conversation did not finish.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Det senaste försöket att öppna den här konversationen slutfördes inte."}}}},
    "The repair chat could not be created.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Reparationschatten kunde inte skapas."}}}},
    "The repair chat has been filed away.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Reparationschatten har arkiverats."}}}},
    "The repaired file could not be put back: %@": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Den reparerade filen kunde inte läggas tillbaka: %@"}}}},
    "The repaired file is outside the working folder Threading prepared.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Den reparerade filen ligger utanför arbetsmappen som Threading förberedde."}}}},
    "The repaired file named by the agent is not there.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Den reparerade fil som agenten angav finns inte där."}}}},
    "This %@ login needs signing in again.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Den här %@-inloggningen behöver loggas in igen."}}}},
    "This chat was not opened to repair a conversation, so there is nothing to propose.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Den här chatten öppnades inte för att reparera en konversation, så det finns inget att föreslå."}}}},
    "this conversation": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "den här konversationen"}}}},
    "Threading has checked the repaired file and will keep a copy of %@ before replacing it.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Threading har kontrollerat den reparerade filen och behåller en kopia av %@ innan den ersätts."}}}},
    "Try Recovering with an Agent": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Försök återställa med en agent"}}}},
    "Use Repaired File": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Använd reparerad fil"}}}},
    "Use the repaired “%@”?": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Använda den reparerade “%@”?"}}}},
    "What the agent printed before it stopped": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Vad agenten skrev ut innan den stoppade"}}}},
    "What was done": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Vad som gjordes"}}}},
    "What was wrong": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Vad som var fel"}}}},
    "ADOPTION couldn’t start": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ADOPTION kunde inte starta"}}}},
    "Codex could not read this conversation's saved file, so it stopped instead of resuming.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Codex kunde inte läsa den här konversationens sparade fil och stoppade i stället för att återuppta."}}}},
    "LaunchFailureView": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "LaunchFailureView"}}}},
    "What a session shows when its agent died on the way up. The well is the point: an agent that refuses to start prints its reason to a terminal that is then torn down, and on the specimen this was built against the message was legible for one frame. Select the text — copying it is most of what this surface is for. It does not wrap, because a wrapped stack trace stops looking like the thing the terminal showed.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Vad en session visar när dess agent dog på väg upp. Rutan är hela poängen: en agent som vägrar starta skriver ut sitt skäl till en terminal som sedan rivs ner, och i det exemplar detta byggdes mot var meddelandet läsbart i en enda bildruta. Markera texten — att kunna kopiera den är det mesta av vad den här ytan är till för. Den radbryts inte, eftersom en radbruten stackspårning slutar likna det terminalen visade."}}}},
    "Two or three fixed choices with selection, arrows, and radio-group accessibility. The second run carries a state mark per choice, so the panel you are not looking at still says where it stands.": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Två eller tre fasta val med markering, piltangenter och radiogruppstillgänglighet. Den andra raden bär ett tillståndsmärke per val, så panelen du inte tittar på säger ändå var den står."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@, help": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%@, hjälp"}}}},
    "HelpPopoverButton": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "HelpPopoverButton"}}}},
    "A quiet mark beside a name, the themed panel it opens, and the same words on the button for a screen reader.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ett diskret märke bredvid ett namn, panelen det öppnar och samma ord på knappen för en skärmläsare."}}}},
    "ready": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "klar"}}}},
    "needs attention": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "behöver åtgärd"}}}},
    "A paired device can see and manage your chats, send prompts, and review permission requests.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "En parkopplad enhet kan se och hantera dina chattar, skicka prompter och granska behörighetsförfrågningar."}}}},
    "Collaborative lets everyone with reply access send. Focused starts with the Mac owner in control.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Samarbete låter alla med svarsåtkomst skicka. Fokuserat börjar med Mac-ägaren i kontroll."}}}},
    "It grants only the selected chat, with view, collaboration and approval rights chosen separately. The invitation points at a way in above, so the person needs the Threading app and a way onto that network.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Den ger endast åtkomst till den valda chatten, med visning, samarbete och godkännande valda var för sig. Inbjudan pekar på en väg in ovan, så personen behöver Threading-appen och en väg in på det nätverket."}}}},
    "It then prefers a direct encrypted connection. TURN is used only when direct network traversal cannot connect.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Därefter föredras en direkt krypterad anslutning. TURN används endast när direkt nätverkstraversering inte kan ansluta."}}}},
    "Its own workspace keeps that chat out of the checkout you left open. Available for a Git project whose agent has session tools.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "En egen arbetsyta håller chatten borta från utcheckningen du lämnade öppen. Tillgängligt för ett Git-projekt vars agent har sessionsverktyg."}}}},
    "Lets a paired iPhone find this Mac after its address changes.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Låter en parkopplad iPhone hitta den här Macen efter att adressen ändrats."}}}},
    "Pairing this Mac": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Parkoppla den här Macen"}}}},
    "Resetting throws the certificate away and mints a new one. Every paired device has to scan the new pairing code before it can connect again.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Återställning kastar certifikatet och skapar ett nytt. Varje parkopplad enhet måste skanna den nya parkopplingskoden innan den kan ansluta igen."}}}},
    "Rotate or reset this Mac’s identity": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Rotera eller återställ den här Macens identitet"}}}},
    "Shake to report, then Send to Mac, starts a chat here while you are away from it.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Skaka för att rapportera, sedan Skicka till Mac, startar en chatt här medan du är borta från den."}}}},
    "The QR code is owner access.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "QR-koden ger ägaråtkomst."}}}},
    "Turning it off closes every connection and shared-chat link.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Att stänga av den avslutar varje anslutning och delad chattlänk."}}}},
    "Use Share Chat… from that chat’s ⋯ menu.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Använd Dela chatt… i chattens ⋯-meny."}}}},
    "Uses Threading’s service only to introduce this Mac and iPhone.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Använder Threadings tjänst enbart för att presentera den här Macen och iPhone."}}}},
    "You can switch a live chat at any time.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Du kan byta i en pågående chatt när som helst."}}}},
    "Your explicitly paired devices remain paired for the next time.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Dina uttryckligen parkopplade enheter förblir parkopplade till nästa gång."}}}},
    "Your phone compares this code": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Din telefon jämför den här koden"}}}},
    "%lld bounded captures stored on this Mac.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%lld begränsade insamlingar sparade på denna Mac."}}}},
    "1 bounded capture stored on this Mac.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "1 begränsad insamling sparad på denna Mac."}}}},
    "Accepts bounded connection evidence from a paired owner iPhone over the local network. The iPhone has its own independent switch.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Tar emot begränsat anslutningsunderlag från en parkopplad ägar-iPhone via det lokala nätverket. iPhone-enheten har en egen oberoende strömbrytare."}}}},
    "Allow paired-iPhone checkups": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Tillåt kontroller av parkopplad iPhone"}}}},
    "Clear Evidence": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Rensa underlag"}}}},
    "Local Diagnostics": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Lokal diagnostik"}}}},
    "No bounded captures stored on this Mac.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Inga begränsade insamlingar sparade på denna Mac."}}}},
    "Saved iPhone evidence": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Sparat iPhone-underlag"}}}},
