    "%lld other sessions close; their conversations are kept and can be resumed.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%lld andra sessioner stängs; deras konversationer sparas och kan återupptas."}}}},
    "%lld sessions keep working in the background and are taken back on the next launch.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%lld sessioner fortsätter arbeta i bakgrunden och tas tillbaka vid nästa start."}}}},
    "%lld sessions kept running while Threading was closed.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%lld sessioner fortsatte köra medan Threading var stängt."}}}},
    "%lld sessions were lost while Threading was closed. Their conversations can be resumed.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%lld sessioner gick förlorade medan Threading var stängt. Deras konversationer kan återupptas."}}}},
    "%lld turns in flight are lost.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%lld pågående svar går förlorade."}}}},
    "A background host from a different version of Threading is running. It stands down once the sessions it holds have ended.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "En bakgrundsvärd från en annan version av Threading körs. Den avslutas när sessionerna den håller har tagit slut."}}}},
    "Asking the background host what it is holding…": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Frågar bakgrundsvärden vad den håller…"}}}},
    "Background host": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Bakgrundsvärd"}}}},
    "Background Sessions": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Bakgrundssessioner"}}}},
    "Ended": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Avslutad"}}}},
    "Just started": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Nyss startad"}}}},
    "Leave %lld Running": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Låt %lld fortsätta"}}}},
    "Leave One Running": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Låt en fortsätta"}}}},
    "macOS knows the background host but it is switched off. Turning the setting off and on again registers it.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "macOS känner till bakgrundsvärden men den är avstängd. Slå av och på inställningen igen så registreras den."}}}},
    "One other session closes; its conversation is kept and can be resumed.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "En annan session stängs; dess konversation sparas och kan återupptas."}}}},
    "One session keeps working in the background and is taken back on the next launch.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "En session fortsätter arbeta i bakgrunden och tas tillbaka vid nästa start."}}}},
    "One session kept running while Threading was closed.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "En session fortsatte köra medan Threading var stängt."}}}},
    "One session was lost while Threading was closed. Its conversation can be resumed.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "En session gick förlorad medan Threading var stängt. Dess konversation kan återupptas."}}}},
    "Open Login Items…": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Öppna inloggningsobjekt…"}}}},
    "pid %@": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "pid %@"}}}},
    "Quit and leave %lld sessions running?": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Avsluta och låta %lld sessioner fortsätta köra?"}}}},
    "Quit and leave one session running?": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Avsluta och låta en session fortsätta köra?"}}}},
    "Reattach": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Återanslut"}}}},
    "Resume": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Återuppta"}}}},
    "Running for %@": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Har kört i %@"}}}},
    "Runs each agent's terminal in a helper that keeps working while Threading is closed, and hands the sessions back on the next launch. Off while this is still being proven: an agent started by the helper may not inherit Threading's file access.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Kör varje agents terminal i en hjälpprocess som fortsätter arbeta medan Threading är stängt och lämnar tillbaka sessionerna vid nästa start. Avstängd medan detta ännu prövas: en agent som startats av hjälpprocessen ärver kanske inte Threadings filåtkomst."}}}},
    "Stop “%@”?": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Stoppa ”%@”?"}}}},
    "Stop It and Quit": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Stoppa den och avsluta"}}}},
    "Stop Them and Quit": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Stoppa dem och avsluta"}}}},
    "Stops using the helper and removes it from Login Items. Sessions it is still holding keep running; it is removed at the next launch that finds it idle.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Slutar använda hjälpprocessen och tar bort den från inloggningsobjekt. Sessioner som den fortfarande håller fortsätter köra; den tas bort vid nästa start som finner den overksam."}}}},
    "The agent ends and whatever it is working on right now is lost. The conversation is kept and can be resumed from the sidebar.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Agenten avslutas och det den arbetar med just nu går förlorat. Konversationen sparas och kan återupptas från sidopanelen."}}}},
    "The background host cannot open its socket: the path inside your home folder is too long.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Bakgrundsvärden kan inte öppna sin socket: sökvägen i din hemmapp är för lång."}}}},
    "The background host has not been registered with macOS yet.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Bakgrundsvärden har ännu inte registrerats hos macOS."}}}},
    "The background host is holding %lld sessions.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Bakgrundsvärden håller %lld sessioner."}}}},
    "The background host is holding one session.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Bakgrundsvärden håller en session."}}}},
    "The background host is off and has been removed from Login Items.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Bakgrundsvärden är avstängd och har tagits bort från inloggningsobjekt."}}}},
    "The background host is off. Every session runs its terminal inside Threading and ends when Threading quits.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Bakgrundsvärden är avstängd. Varje session kör sin terminal inuti Threading och avslutas när Threading avslutas."}}}},
    "The background host is registered but nothing is listening. It starts again on its own.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Bakgrundsvärden är registrerad men ingenting lyssnar. Den startar igen av sig själv."}}}},
    "The background host is running and holding no sessions.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Bakgrundsvärden körs och håller inga sessioner."}}}},
    "The background host is waiting for your approval in System Settings ▸ General ▸ Login Items.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Bakgrundsvärden väntar på ditt godkännande i Systeminställningar ▸ Allmänt ▸ Inloggningsobjekt."}}}},
    "The turn in flight is lost.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Det pågående svaret går förlorat."}}}},
    "This copy of Threading does not include the background host.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Den här kopian av Threading innehåller inte bakgrundsvärden."}}}},
    "Threading has stopped using the background host. %lld sessions are still running under it, so it stays in Login Items and is removed at the next launch that finds it idle.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Threading har slutat använda bakgrundsvärden. %lld sessioner körs fortfarande under den, så den ligger kvar i inloggningsobjekt och tas bort vid nästa start som finner den overksam."}}}},
    "Threading has stopped using the background host. One session is still running under it, so it stays in Login Items and is removed at the next launch that finds it idle.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Threading har slutat använda bakgrundsvärden. En session körs fortfarande under den, så den ligger kvar i inloggningsobjekt och tas bort vid nästa start som finner den overksam."}}}},
    "Turn off the background host": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Stäng av bakgrundsvärden"}}}},
    "Turn Off": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"sv": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Stäng av"}}}}
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
